Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:55.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:58.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:01.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone! This... is a stick- up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't anybody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:04.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, empty that safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:11.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Money, money, money!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:14.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it, you mean, old potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:17.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Bo Peep, or your sheep get run over!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:19.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Baa! Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.61,0:01:23.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not my sheep! Somebody do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:32.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reach for the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Sheriff Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:37.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here to stop you, One- Eyed Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,How'd you know it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna come quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:43.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't touch me, Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:46.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I brought my attack dog with the built- in force field.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:50.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I brought my dinosaur who eats force- field dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:54.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yipe, yipe, yipe, yipe! You're going to jail, Bart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:58.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the wife and Tater Tots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:01:59.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You saved the day again, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're my favorite deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:14.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:17.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:20.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's wrangle up the cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ When the road looks rough ahead ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:26.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And you're miles and miles from your nice warm bed ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Round 'em up, cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:31.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Just remember what your old pal said ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:34.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Boy you've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yee- haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:37.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Yeah you've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:39.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Some other folks might be a little bit smarter than I am ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Big and stronger too ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.06,0:02:47.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:48.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Maybe ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:53.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ But none of them will ever love you the way I do ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ It's me and you boy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:57.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And as the years go by ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:03.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Our friendship will never die ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:07.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You're gonna see It's our destiny ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:10.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:12.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Yeah you've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Score!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:19.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- ∮ You got a friend in me ∮ - ∮ Wow! Cool! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:22.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do you think? - Oh, this looks great, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, birthday boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,We saw that at the store! I asked you for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I hope I have enough places. - Wow, look at that! That's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:30.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One, two... Four. - Oh, my gosh, you got...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I think that's gonna be enough. - Could we leave this up 'til we move?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, sure! We can leave it up. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:36.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now go get Molly. Your friends are gonna be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:40.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. It's party time, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:43.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yee... haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:48.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Howdy, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:57.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody's poisoned the water hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:58.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:00.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're getting heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,See you later, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull my string! The birthday party's today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:18.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody, coast is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ages 3 and up. It's on my box...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:31.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ages 3 and up. I'm not supposed to be baby- sitting Princess Drool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:45.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hamm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look, I'm Picasso! - I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:53.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You uncultured swine! What're you lookin' at, ya hockey puck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:00.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Sarge, have you seen Slinky? - Sir! No, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:03.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Hey, thank you. At ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Slinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:08.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right here, Woody. I'm red this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. Slink... - Oh, well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:12.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can be red if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:16.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not now, Slink. I got some bad news. - Bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just gather everyone up for a staff meeting, and be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:25.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Staff meeting, everybody! Snake, Robot, podium duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Etch. Draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:37.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Got me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:40.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Etch, you've been working on that draw. Fastest knobs in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got a staff meeting, you guys. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:46.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, where is that... Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:49.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, who moved my doodle pad way over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:54.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How're you doin', Rex? - Were you scared? Tell me honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:57.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was close to being scared that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:06:00.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going for fearsome here, but I just don't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:03.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I'm just coming off as annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Bo. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:09.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you, Woody, for saving my flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:11.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it was, uh, nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:16.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you say I get someone else to watch the sheep tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:24.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember, I'm just a couple of blocks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:26.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yodel-ay-hee-hoo! - Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Smaller toys up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Woody, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:36.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay... Whoa whoa. Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- For crying out loud. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:47.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Check. That better? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:51.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody hear me? Up on the shelf, can you hear me? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:54.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. First item today:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Has everyone picked a moving buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Moving buddy? You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't know we were supposed to have one already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:05.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do we have to hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:07.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys think this is a big joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've only got one week left before the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:12.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want any toys left behind. A moving buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you don't have one, get one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:18.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, next. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:22.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tuesday night's plastic corrosion awareness meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,was, I think, a big success.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:27.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we wanna thank Mr. Spell for putting that on for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:30.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, Mr. Spell. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:34.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Oh, yes. One minor note here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:37.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's birthday party has been moved to today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:38.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:41.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean the party's today? His birthday's not 'til next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's goin' on down there? Is his mom losin' her marbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:48.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously she wanted to have the party before the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried. You shouldn't be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:53.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course Woody ain't worried. He's been Andy's favorite since kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:56.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Come on, Potato Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:59.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,If Woody says it's all right, then, well, darn it, it's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:02.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody has never steered us wrong before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:06.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. Every Christmas and birthday we go through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:09.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,But what if Andy gets another dinosaur, a mean one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just don't think I could take that kind of rejection!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, no one's getting replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:16.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Andy we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:20.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how much we're played with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,What matters is that we're here for Andy when he needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:28.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what we're made for, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:32.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pardon me. I hate to break up the staff meeting, but... they're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:34.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Birthday guests at three o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:37.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:41.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Meeting adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:44.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ho, boy! Will you take a look at all those presents?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:46.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:52.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, we're next month's garage sale fodder for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:55.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Any dinosaur- shaped ones? - Oh, for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:59.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're all in box. Es, you idiot. - They're getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's a nice little one over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:13.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I send out the troops, will you all calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes! Yes! We promise! - Okay! Save your batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:19.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very good, Woody. That's using the old noodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:26.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sergeant, establish a recon post downstairs. Code Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You know what to do. - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:31.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, men. You heard him. Code Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:34.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Repeat, we are at Code Red. Recon plan Charlie. Ex. Ecute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:35.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's move! Move, move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:36.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:58.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:00.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, come on, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the living room. It's almost time for the presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, gangway, gangway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:31.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this is how we find out
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,what is in those presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:40.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, who's hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here come the chips!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:45.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got Cool Ranch and barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,What in the world... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:50.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought I told him to pick these up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:53.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't they be there by now? What's taking them so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:57.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, these guys are professionals. They're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:59.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! They're not lying down on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on without me! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:15.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,A good soldier never leaves a man behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:35.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:38.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody settle down. Now, kids. Everybody...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:42.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sit in a circle. No, Andy. Andy, you sit in the middle there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:45.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good. And... Which present are you gonna open first?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:49.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mine! - There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:52.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in Mother Bird. This is Alpha Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:55.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is it! This is it! Quiet, quiet! - Come in Mother Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:58.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right Andy's opening the first present now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:01.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Potato Head! Mrs. Potato Head! Mrs. Potato Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:03.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can dream, can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:06.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,The bow's coming off. He's ripping the wrapping paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:08.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a... It's... It's a... a lunch bo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We've got a lunch bo here. - A lunch box?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lunch box? - For lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:15.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay second present. It appears to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:18.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay it's bed sheets. - Who invited that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:28.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay we're on the last present now. - Last present!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a big one. It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's a board game! Repeat Battleship! - Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hallelujah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah! All right! - Hey, watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:39.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry there, old spud head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:43.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished. Well done, men. Pack it up. We're goin' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,So did I tell ya? Nothin' to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:49.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I knew you were right all along, Woody. Never doubted ya for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:52.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do we have here? - Wait! Turn that thing back on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:58.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in Mother Bird! Come in Mother Bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom has pulled a surprise present from the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's opening it. He's really ex. Cited about this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:05.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mom, what is it? - It's a huge package.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, get outta the... One of the kids is in the way. I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's a... - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:16.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a what? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:18.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! - Oh, ya big lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:21.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now we'll never know what it is! - Way to go, Rex!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no! Turn him around! Turn him around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:26.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's puttin' 'em in backwa... Here, you're puttin' 'em in backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:30.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Plus is positive, minus is negative! Oh, let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:32.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go to my room, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:35.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Red alert! Red alert! Andy is coming upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:37.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There! - Juvenile intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Repeat resume your positions now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:41.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's coming! Everybody, back to your places! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get to your places! Get to your places!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's my ear? Who's seen my ear? Did you see my ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:50.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Out of my way! Here I come! Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:03.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, its lasers light up. Take that, Zurg!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:06.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick, make a space. This is where the spaceship lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:09.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,And he does it like that. And he does a karate chop action!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:12.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on down, guys! It's time for games! We've got prizes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:28.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- what's it - Can you see we've got prizes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:32.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What the heck is up there? - Woody, who's up there with ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:38.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing under the bed? - Nothin'. Nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:41.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Andy was just a little ex. Cited, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Too much cake and ice cream, I suppose. It's just a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.85,0:14:47.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that mistake is sitting in your spot, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:50.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Have you been replaced? - What did I tell you earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one is getting replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, let's all be polite and give whatever it is up there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:15:00.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,a nice, big Andy's- room welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:16.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:27.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear to Star Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in, Star Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:32.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Star Command, come in. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:35.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't they answer? My ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:38.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Blast! This'll take weeks to repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:45.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear mission log, stardate 4- 0- 7- 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:48.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,My ship has run off course en route to sector 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:51.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've crash- landed on a strange planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,The impact must've awoken me from hypersleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:58.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Terrain seems a bit unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:01.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,No readout yet if the air is breathable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:05.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,And there seems to be no sign of intelligent life anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:06.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:08.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hey! Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:11.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I frighten you? Didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:14.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Howdy. My name is Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:18.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this is Andy's room. That's all I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,And also, there has been a bit of a mix-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:23.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is my spot, see, the bed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Local law enforcement. It's about time you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Buzz Lightyear, Space Ranger, Universe Protection Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:31.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,My ship has crash- landed here by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:34.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is a mistake because, you see, the bed here is my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need to repair my turbo boosters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:39.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you people still use fossil fuel, or have you discovered crystallic fusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:41.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see. We got double- A's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself! Halt! Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot! It's okay. Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you know these life- forms? - Yes! They're Andy's toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:52.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, you're clear to come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:55.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am Buzz Lightyear. I come in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:59.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so glad you're not a dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:01.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wh- why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:04.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, thank you all for your kind welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:07.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Say, what's that button do? - I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:09.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Woody's got something like that. His is a pull string.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.93,0:17:15.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Only it's... - Only it sounds like a car ran over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:19.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, but not like this. This is a quality sound system.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Probably all copper wiring, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:24.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, where you from? Singapore? Hong Kong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:28.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, no. Actually, I'm stationed up in the Gamma Quadrant of Sector Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:31.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,As a member of the elite Universe Protection Unit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,of the Space Ranger Corps,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:35.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I protect the galaxy from the threat of invasion
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:39.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,from the evil Emperor Zurg, sworn enemy of the Galactic Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? I'm from Playskool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:45.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'm from Mattel. Well, I'm not really from Mattel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:48.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm actually from a smaller company that was purchased in a leveraged buyout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:51.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd think they'd never seen a new toy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:55.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, sure. Look at him. He's got more gadgets on him than a Swiss Army knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:18:00.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be in the way when my laser goes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, a laser! How come you don't have a laser, Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:06.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not a laser! It's a... It's a little light bulb that blinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:08.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's with him? - Laser envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:09.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:12.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, we're all very impressed with Andy's new toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:15.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Toy? - T- O- Y. Toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:19.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ex. Cuse me, I think the word you're searching for is "Space Ranger."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:24.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,The word I'm searching for I can't say because there's preschool toys present.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:25.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gettin' kinda tense, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:28.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Lightyear, now, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:31.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What does a Space Ranger actually do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:33.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's not a Space Ranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:37.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,He doesn't fight evil or, or shoot lasers or fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ex. Cuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, impressive wingspan! Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:48.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, what? What? These are plastic. He can't fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:51.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are a terillium- carbonic alloy, and I can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:54.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, you can't. - Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:56.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't. - Can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't. Can't. Can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tell you, I could fly around this room with my eyes closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:04.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, then, Mr. Light Beer, prove it. - All right, then, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:06.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stand back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:17.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:46.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can! - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:49.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, you flew magnificently!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:53.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I found my movin' buddy. - Thank you. Thank you all. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:57.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,That wasn't flying! That was... falling with style.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:20:00.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, the dolls must really go for you. Can you teach me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:04.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Golly bob howdy! - Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:05.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, in a couple of days,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:08.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,everything will be just the way it was. They'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:10.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:13.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm still Andy's favorite toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:16.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I was on top of the world livin' high ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:18.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ It was right in my pocket ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:20.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:23.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I was livin' the life ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:26.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things were just the way they should be ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ When from out of the sky like a bomb ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:33.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Comes some little punk in a rocket ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:39.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Now all of a sudden some strange things are happening to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:45.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things are happening to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:53.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:56.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:21:01.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Strange things are happening to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Ain't no doubt about it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.19,0:21:09.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:14.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I had friends I had lots of friends ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:17.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Now all my friends are gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:21.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And I'm doin' the best I can ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ To carry on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:27.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I had power ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I was respected ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:32.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ But not any more ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:34.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And I've lost the love of the one ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:37.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Whom I adore ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:42.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Let me tell you 'bout it Strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:45.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things are happenin' to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:50.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:52.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:56.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:59.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things are happenin' to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.31,0:22:01.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Ain't no doubt about it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.45,0:22:08.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.09,0:22:10.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:14.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:16.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Things ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.33,0:22:20.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.34,0:22:23.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's got my hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm Woody! Howdy, howdy, howdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gimme that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.81,0:22:32.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say there, Lizard and Stretchy Dog, let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:35.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It looks as though I've been accepted into your culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:38.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your chief, Andy, inscribed his name on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.75,0:22:42.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,With permanent ink too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:45.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I must get back to repairing my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:50.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get to you, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:52.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let what? I don't... What do you mean? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:55.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know Andy's ex. Cited about Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:59.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you know he'll always have a special place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.51,0:23:03.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, like the attic. - All right, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unidirectional bonding strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:08.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Lightyear wants more tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.82,0:23:14.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, Light Snack, you stay away from Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:18.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's mine, and no one is taking him away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:19.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:22.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's that bonding strip?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:25.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,And another thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop with this spaceman thing! It's getting on my nerves!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:31.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you wanna lodge a complaint with Star Command?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:35.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay! Well, so you wanna do it the hard way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:39.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't even think about it, cowboy. - Oh, yeah, tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.76,0:23:53.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,The air isn't... tox. Ic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:57.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,How dare you open a spaceman's helmet on an uncharted planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:24:01.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,My eyeballs could've been sucked from their sockets!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:05.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You actually think you're the Buzz Lightyear?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.77,0:24:08.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, all this time I thought it was an act!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look! It's the real Buzz Lightyear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:14.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're mocking me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.11,0:24:16.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no. No, no, no, no, no. Buzz, look, an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.95,0:24:18.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:21.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:28.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:34.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:35.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought he was at summer camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:37.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,They must've kicked him out early this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.57,0:24:40.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.17,0:24:41.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.21,0:24:46.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who is it this time? - I... I can't... I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.85,0:24:48.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, where's Lenny? - Right here, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:53.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I can't bear to watch one of these again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.22,0:24:56.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's a Combat Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:24:57.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:25:01.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing that concerns you spacemen, just us toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.16,0:25:02.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd better take a look anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.83,0:25:06.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why is that soldier strapped to an ex. Plosive device?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.27,0:25:08.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why: Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.97,0:25:11.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure is a hairy fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.87,0:25:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, that's Scud, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.04,0:25:16.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.61,0:25:19.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You mean that happy child? - That ain't no happy child.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.85,0:25:23.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,He tortures toys, just for fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.35,0:25:28.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then we've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.92,0:25:30.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:33.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna teach that boy a lesson. - Yeah, sure. You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.03,0:25:36.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melt him with your scary laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:39.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be careful with that! It's extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.80,0:25:42.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's lighting it! He's lighting it! Hit the dirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.07,0:25:45.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:51.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! He's gone! He's history!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:55.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could've stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.25,0:25:58.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, I would love to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.52,0:26:01.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'd love to see you as a crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.45,0:26:04.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,The sooner we move, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.89,0:26:06.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:10.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:14.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.27,0:26:17.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,All this packing makes me hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.00,0:26:20.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,What would you say to dinner at, oh, Pizza Planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.94,0:26:23.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pizza Planet? Oh, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:27.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go wash your hands, and I'll get Molly ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.31,0:26:30.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I bring some toys? - You can bring one toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.32,0:26:33.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just one? - One toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.09,0:26:40.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will Andy pick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.80,0:26:43.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.93,0:26:45.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Don't count on it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Oh, Buzz! Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.82,0:27:12.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear, thank goodness. We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.53,0:27:15.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Trouble? Where? - Down there. Just down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.37,0:27:18.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,A helpless toy, it's... it's trapped, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:20.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then we've no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.98,0:27:27.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.74,0:27:29.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's there! Just, just keep looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.05,0:27:31.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,What kind of toy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:52.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.54,0:27:55.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't see him in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.41,0:27:59.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I think he bounced into Sid's yard! - Oh! Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.41,0:28:05.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, R.C.'s trying to say something. What is it, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.78,0:28:09.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's saying that this was no accident. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.22,0:28:11.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I mean Humpty- Dumpty was pushed... - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.62,0:28:12.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,...by Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:15.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.12,0:28:17.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't think I meant to knock Buzz out the window, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.19,0:28:19.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Potato Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.73,0:28:22.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's Mr. Potato Head to you, you back- stabbing murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:24.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, it was an accident, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.63,0:28:27.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Now, you, you gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.74,0:28:30.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,We believe ya, Woody. Right, Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.97,0:28:33.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, ye... N... I don't like confrontations!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:37.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is your honor, dirt bag? You are an absolute disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.31,0:28:39.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't deserve to... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:42.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You couldn't handle Buzz cutting in on your playtime, could you, Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.39,0:28:46.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't wanna face the fact that Buzz just might be Andy's new favorite toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:47.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you got rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:50.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what if Andy starts playing with me more, Woody, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.73,0:28:53.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gonna knock me outta the window too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.13,0:28:55.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think we should give him the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.10,0:28:56.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,There he is, men. Frag him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.93,0:28:58.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's string him up by his pull string!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.70,0:29:01.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I got dibs on his hat! - Would you boys stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.17,0:29:02.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tackle him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.64,0:29:04.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Wait! I can ex. Plain everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.97,0:29:08.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mom, be right down. I've gotta get Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.14,0:29:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.85,0:29:16.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom, do you know where Buzz is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.79,0:29:17.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:23.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Andy, I'm heading out the door! - But, Mom, I can't find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.79,0:29:26.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Honey, just grab some other toy. Now, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.33,0:29:28.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:36.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I couldn't find my Buzz. I know I left him right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.91,0:29:40.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Honey, I'm sure he's around. You'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.89,0:29:56.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too short! We need more monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.69,0:29:59.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,There aren't any more! That's the whole barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.93,0:30:03.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, the monkeys aren't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:07.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're formulating another plan! Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.27,0:30:09.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, where could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.57,0:30:12.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:19.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.22,0:30:24.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I help pump the gas? - Sure! I'll even let you drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.32,0:30:26.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah? - Yeah, when you're 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.09,0:30:28.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Funny, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.62,0:30:33.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great. How am I gonna convince those guys it was an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.40,0:30:38.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.53,0:30:42.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Ha! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.61,0:30:45.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is great! Oh, I'm saved! I'm saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:48.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy'll find you here, he'll take us back to the room
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:53.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,and then you can tell everyone that this was all just a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.85,0:30:56.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Huh? Right? Buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.79,0:31:00.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just want you to know that even though you tried to terminate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.32,0:31:03.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,revenge is not an idea we promote on my planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.19,0:31:07.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh. Well, that's good. - But we're not on my planet, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.20,0:31:08.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.87,0:31:17.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.24,0:31:19.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want a piece of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:28.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Buzz Buzz Lightyear to the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.65,0:31:31.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Next stop. - Pizza Planet! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.09,0:31:35.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.90,0:31:47.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wh... Doesn't he realize that I'm not there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.87,0:31:50.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.08,0:31:54.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm a lost toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.08,0:32:00.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear mission log.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:04.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,The local sheriff and I seem to be at a huge refueling station of some sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.15,0:32:05.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.98,0:32:28.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- According to my navi- computer, the... - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.61,0:32:31.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just shut up, you idiot! - Sheriff, this is no time to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.05,0:32:35.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect time to panic. I'm lost. Andy is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.55,0:32:38.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're gonna move from their house in two days, and it's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.09,0:32:41.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,My... My fault? If you hadn't pushed me out of the window in the first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.19,0:32:42.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:45.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, if you hadn't shown up in your stupid little cardboard spaceship
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.46,0:32:47.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,and taken away everything that was important to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.66,0:32:49.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me about importance!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.33,0:32:52.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because of you the security of this entire universe is in jeopardy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.60,0:32:54.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? What are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:57.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right now, poised at the edge of the galaxy, Emperor Zurg
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.77,0:32:59.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,has been secretly building a weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:02.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,with the destructive capacity to annihilate an entire planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.55,0:33:06.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I alone have information that reveals this weapon's only weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:09.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you, my friend, are responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.39,0:33:12.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,for delaying my rendezvous with Star Command!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.06,0:33:16.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You... are... a... toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.33,0:33:18.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You aren't the real Buzz Lightyear! You're a...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.66,0:33:23.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're an action figure! You are a child's plaything!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:28.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are a sad, strange little man, and you have my pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.24,0:33:29.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.41,0:33:32.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Well, good riddance, ya loony!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:35.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Rendezvous with Star Command."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.88,0:33:38.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, gas dude! - You talkin' to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.38,0:33:41.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, man. Can you help me? - Pizza Planet? Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.58,0:33:43.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Cutting Boulevard is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.32,0:33:44.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.82,0:33:47.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't show my face in that room without Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.99,0:33:50.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz! Buzz, come back! - Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.99,0:33:54.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Buzz, you gotta come back! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.46,0:33:55.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.97,0:33:58.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I found a spaceship!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.64,0:34:01.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a spaceship, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:07.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, hurry up! Like, the pizzas are getting cold here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.21,0:34:10.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cutting Boulevard, huh? - Yeah, yeah. Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.95,0:34:13.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, you're sure this space freighter will return to its port of origin
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.05,0:34:16.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,once it jettisons its food supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.45,0:34:20.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when we get there, we'll be able to find a way to transport you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.02,0:34:24.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, then, let's climb aboard. - No, no, no, wait, Buzz! Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.66,0:34:26.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get in the back. No one will see us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.73,0:34:30.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Negative. There are no restraining harnesses in the cargo area.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.13,0:34:32.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We'll be much safer in the cockpit. - Yeah, bu...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.37,0:34:34.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:36.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's two lefts and a right, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.31,0:34:39.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thanks for the directions, okay? - Yeah. And remember, kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.31,0:34:40.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:56.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's safer in the cockpit than the cargo bay. What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.28,0:35:15.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.75,0:35:23.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Net shuttle lift- off is scheduled for
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.39,0:35:26.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,T- minus 30 minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.73,0:35:31.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are clear to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.99,0:35:33.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Pizza Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.80,0:35:35.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.20,0:35:37.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,The white zone is for immediate pizza...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.60,0:35:38.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.67,0:35:42.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.91,0:35:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, the entrance is heavily guarded. We need a way to get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.08,0:35:48.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great idea, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.68,0:35:51.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like your thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.51,0:35:54.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are clear to enter. Welcome to Pizza Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:56.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.45,0:35:59.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quickly, Sheriff! The air lock is closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.49,0:36:02.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones party of five your shuttle is now boarding...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.66,0:36:04.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom, can we have some tokens?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.69,0:36:06.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.96,0:36:08.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:18.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ten nine eight seven six...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.74,0:36:22.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,five four three...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.44,0:36:24.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,two one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.58,0:36:28.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a spaceport! Good work, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.15,0:36:30.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.29,0:36:32.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.39,0:36:36.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.29,0:36:39.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom, can I play Black Hole? Please, please, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:41.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Andy! - Now, we need to find a ship
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.40,0:36:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- that's headed for Sector 12. - Wait a minute. No, Buzz! This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.43,0:36:47.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There's a special ship. I just saw it. - You mean it has hyperdrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.07,0:36:50.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hyperactive hyperdrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.47,0:36:53.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Astro... turf!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.81,0:36:56.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where is it? I don't see the... - Come on. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.61,0:36:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spaceship!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.75,0:36:59.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.88,0:37:03.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, Buzz, get ready. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.12,0:37:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And the universe ex. Plodes! - Okay, Buzz, when I say go,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.59,0:37:07.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,we're gonna jump in the basket. Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.52,0:37:09.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.79,0:37:11.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - Mom, if I eat all my pizza,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.36,0:37:12.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,can I have some alien slime?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.53,0:37:15.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,This cannot be happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.14,0:37:27.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A stranger. - From the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:32.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Greetings. I am Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.11,0:37:35.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I come in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.02,0:37:39.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before your space journey re- energize yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.92,0:37:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,with a slice of pepperoni now boarding at counter three.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.19,0:37:46.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is an intergalactic emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:49.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need to commandeer your vessel to Sector 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.26,0:37:51.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's in charge here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.83,0:37:54.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,The claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.14,0:37:57.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,The claw is our master.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.57,0:38:00.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,The claw chooses who will go and who will stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.17,0:38:03.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is ludicrous. - Hey, bozo, you got a brain in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.71,0:38:06.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.25,0:38:10.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.12,0:38:11.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.42,0:38:13.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.42,0:38:14.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you? I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.96,0:38:16.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are the one that decided to climb into this...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.89,0:38:20.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,The claw, it moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have been chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:30.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my friends. I go on to a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.17,0:38:32.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.24,0:38:37.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Buzz Lightyear? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.73,0:38:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.33,0:38:57.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:00.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.30,0:39:03.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,He has been chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.37,0:39:05.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He must go. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.44,0:39:07.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - Do not fight the claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:09.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it, you zealots!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.41,0:39:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right! Double prizes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:20.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go home and... play.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.74,0:39:37.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sheriff, I can see your dwelling from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:39.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're almost home. - Nirvana is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.17,0:39:41.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The mystic portal awaits. - Will you be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.71,0:39:43.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:46.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once we go into Sid's house, we won't be coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.65,0:39:49.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Scud! Hey, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.65,0:39:51.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sit! Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.75,0:39:55.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, I got something for you, boy. - Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.96,0:39:59.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready, set, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.63,0:40:03.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hannah! Hey, Hannah!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.10,0:40:05.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Did I get my package in the mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.43,0:40:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know. - What do you mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:09.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.34,0:40:13.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no, Hannah! Look, janie! - What? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.31,0:40:15.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She's sick! - No, she's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.31,0:40:17.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll have to perform one of my operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.58,0:40:20.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - No, not Sid's room. Not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.35,0:40:22.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, give her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.45,0:40:24.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sid! Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.92,0:40:28.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, we have a sick patient here, nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prepare the OR, stat!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.39,0:40:34.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Patient is... prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.20,0:40:40.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one's ever attempted a double bypass brain transplant before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.04,0:40:44.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now for the tricky part. Pliers!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.64,0:40:47.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that man's ever been to medical school.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.14,0:40:51.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doctor, you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.81,0:40:52.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.95,0:40:55.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hannah!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:58.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Janie's all better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.15,0:41:01.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mom! Mom! - She's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.49,0:41:04.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever she says, it's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.43,0:41:11.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.20,0:41:16.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.17,0:41:18.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are gonna die. I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.04,0:41:25.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.35,0:41:27.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be another way outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.99,0:41:42.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz? Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.94,0:41:54.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hi there, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.11,0:41:57.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come out here. Do you know a way outta here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.81,0:42:28.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.86,0:42:42.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're cannibals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.19,0:42:47.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mayday, mayday.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.43,0:42:49.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in, Star Command. Send reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.73,0:42:52.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Star Command, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.60,0:42:55.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've set my laser from stun to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.17,0:42:59.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great. Great. Yeah, and if anyone attacks us, we can blink 'em to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:04.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, I think I found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.65,0:43:07.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.42,0:43:09.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whiskers, will you get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.72,0:43:12.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're interfering with the search and rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.02,0:43:15.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, they're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.23,0:43:22.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom, have you seen Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.73,0:43:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where was the last place you left him? - Right here in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.53,0:43:28.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure he's there. You're just not looking hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.97,0:43:30.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's not here, Mom. Woody's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.31,0:43:33.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.54,0:43:35.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, boy, the weasel ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.78,0:43:38.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh? I told you he was guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.08,0:43:42.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who would've thought he was capable of such atrocities?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.12,0:43:46.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Slink, I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.46,0:43:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, a survivor. Where's the rebel base? Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.60,0:43:59.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can see your will is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.60,0:44:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we have ways of making you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.81,0:44:17.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are your rebel friends now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.62,0:44:20.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sid, your Pop Tarts are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.15,0:44:22.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.63,0:44:36.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? I'm proud of you, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.07,0:44:38.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,A lesser man would've talked under such torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.84,0:44:42.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I sure hope this isn't permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.11,0:44:44.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Still no word from Star Command. We're not that far from the space port.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.81,0:44:47.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,The door. It's open! We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.88,0:44:50.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody, we don't know what's out there! - I'll tell you wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.15,0:44:54.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're gonna eat us, Buzz! Do something quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.76,0:44:57.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shield your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:45:01.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not working. I recharged it before I left. It should be good for...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.83,0:45:05.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,You idiot! You're a toy! Use your karate chop action!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.33,0:45:07.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get away! - Hey! Hey! How're you doin' that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.87,0:45:10.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stop that. - Back! Back, you savages! Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.97,0:45:14.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody, stop it! - Sorry, guys, but dinner's canceled!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.98,0:45:18.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no place like home! There's no place like home!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.55,0:45:19.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.16,0:45:36.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another stunt like that, cowboy, you're gonna get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.03,0:45:39.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.25,0:46:01.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw! Giddyap pardner!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.56,0:46:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got to get this wagon train a- movin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.53,0:46:08.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.89,0:46:33.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Calling Buzz Lightyear. Come in Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.75,0:46:35.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Star Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.56,0:46:39.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Star Command! - Buzz Lightyear responding. Read you loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.06,0:46:42.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear planet Earth needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.36,0:46:44.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- On the way! - Buzz Lightyear!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.87,0:46:48.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,The world's greatest superhero! Now the world's greatest toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.04,0:46:51.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz has it all! Locking wrist communicator!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.94,0:46:54.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Calling Buzz Lightyear! - Karate chop action!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.74,0:46:57.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wow! - Pulsating laser light!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.44,0:46:59.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Total annihilation! - Multi- phase voice simulator!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.01,0:47:05.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a secret mission in uncharted space.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.19,0:47:07.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,And best of all high pressure space wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.96,0:47:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- To infinity and beyond! - Not a flying toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.73,0:47:13.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your Buzz Lightyear action figure
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.89,0:47:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- and save a galay near you! - Buzz Lightyear!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.43,0:47:20.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Available at all Al's Toy Barn outlets in the tri- county area.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.00,0:47:23.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.70,0:47:24.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.41,0:47:31.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Out among the stars I sit ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.78,0:47:34.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Way beyond the moon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.88,0:47:40.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ In my silver ship I sailed ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.49,0:47:44.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ To a dream that ended too soon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.73,0:47:47.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Now I know eactly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:51.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Who I am and what I'm here for ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:54.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You are a toy! You can't fly! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.47,0:48:00.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And I will go sailing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.21,0:48:04.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ No more ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.15,0:48:13.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ But no it can't be true ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.42,0:48:16.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I could fly if I wanted to ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:19.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Like a bird in the sky ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.19,0:48:22.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ If I believed I could fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.26,0:48:25.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Why I'd fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.47,0:48:28.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.02,0:48:47.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Clearly I ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.79,0:48:52.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Will go sailing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.66,0:48:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ No more ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.21,0:49:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom, have you seen my Sally doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.28,0:49:14.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,What, dear? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.02,0:49:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.59,0:49:27.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, the coast is clear. Buzz, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.56,0:49:31.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a secret mission in uncharted space. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.17,0:49:35.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really? That is so interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.24,0:49:37.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you like some tea, Mrs. Nesbitt?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.74,0:49:39.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.81,0:49:42.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so nice you could join us on such late notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.51,0:49:46.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! - What a lovely hat, Mrs. Nesbitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.48,0:49:48.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It goes quite well with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.58,0:49:52.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hannah! Oh, Hannah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.09,0:49:54.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom? Please ex. Cuse me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.99,0:49:57.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.46,0:50:03.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mom? Mom, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.43,0:50:06.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz. Hey. Buzz, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.33,0:50:09.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gone! It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.57,0:50:12.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of it's gone. Bye- bye. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.37,0:50:13.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.51,0:50:16.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,One minute you're defending the whole galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.38,0:50:20.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,And suddenly you find yourself suckin' down Darjeeling with
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.91,0:50:23.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marie Antoinette and her little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:27.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you've had enough tea for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.89,0:50:29.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get you outta here, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.89,0:50:32.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it? You see the hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.89,0:50:37.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I am Mrs. Nesbitt! - Snap out of it, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.50,0:50:43.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I... You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.80,0:50:45.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am just a little depressed. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.80,0:50:48.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.47,0:50:50.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm a sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.51,0:50:52.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look at me. - Quiet, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.28,0:50:54.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't even fly out of a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.81,0:50:59.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,The hat looked good? Tell me the hat looked good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.28,0:51:01.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.19,0:51:03.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, you're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.42,0:51:05.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.52,0:51:08.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Years of academy, training, wasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.46,0:51:10.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,B- 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.76,0:51:12.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss! G- 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.77,0:51:15.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sunk it. Are you peeking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.27,0:51:18.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit your whinin' and pay up. No, no, not the ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.64,0:51:21.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Give me the nose. Come on. - How about three out of five?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.51,0:51:26.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Guys! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.21,0:51:28.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Son of a building block. It's Woody. - He's in the psycho's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.55,0:51:31.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hi! - Everyone! It's Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.82,0:51:32.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.95,0:51:35.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - We're gonna get outta here, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.02,0:51:38.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.83,0:51:44.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, look! - Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.63,0:51:46.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, am I glad to see you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.57,0:51:49.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I knew you'd come back, Woody. - What are you doin' over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.30,0:51:51.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a long story, Bo. I'll ex. Plain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.67,0:51:53.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here! Catch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.84,0:51:57.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Whoa! I've got it, Woody. - He got it, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.41,0:52:00.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good goin', Slink. Now just, just tie it on to somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.38,0:52:02.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait. I got a better idea. How 'bout we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.95,0:52:04.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey! - Potato Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.38,0:52:06.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you all take stupid pills this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.19,0:52:08.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten what he did to Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.25,0:52:10.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,And now you wanna let him back over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.32,0:52:14.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No, no, no, no, no! You got it... You got it all wrong, Potato Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.59,0:52:16.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz is fine. Buzz is right here. He's with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.03,0:52:20.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You are a liar! - No, I'm not. Buzz, come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.40,0:52:25.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell the nice toys that you're... that you're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.11,0:52:28.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell the nice toys that you're... that you're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.24,0:52:32.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, will you get up here and give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.78,0:52:35.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's very funny, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.15,0:52:37.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is serious! - Hey, Woody! Where'd ya go?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.72,0:52:39.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's lying. Buzz ain't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.79,0:52:42.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hi, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.06,0:52:46.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say hello to the guys over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.26,0:52:49.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hiya, fellas! To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.76,0:52:51.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.63,0:52:56.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buzz, let's show the guys our new secret best friends handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.07,0:52:58.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me five, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.20,0:52:59.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something's screwy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.04,0:53:02.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you see we're friends now, guys. Aren't we, Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.57,0:53:04.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You bet. Give me a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.58,0:53:07.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boy, I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.11,0:53:08.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? It is Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.01,0:53:11.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now give back the lights, Potato Head. - Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.82,0:53:14.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you tryin' to pull? - Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.79,0:53:20.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, that is disgusting. - Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.79,0:53:23.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! No, no, no, no, no! - You murdering dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.16,0:53:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's not what you think. I swear! - Save it for the jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.53,0:53:27.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope Sid pulls your voice box. Out, ya creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.80,0:53:30.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no! No, no! Don't leave! Don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.14,0:53:32.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ya gotta help us, please! You don't know what it's like over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.91,0:53:34.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.71,0:53:37.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go back to your lives, citizens. Show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.28,0:53:39.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back! Slink!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.38,0:53:43.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Slink! Please! Please! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.78,0:53:47.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.15,0:53:50.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Slinky!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.36,0:54:01.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.17,0:54:02.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You disgusting freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.27,0:54:06.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, back! Back, you cannibals!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.81,0:54:15.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,He is still alive, and you're not gonna get him, you monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.11,0:54:16.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.38,0:54:21.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, they fix. Ed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.69,0:54:26.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,But they're cannibals.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:30.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,We saw them eat those other toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.67,0:54:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I thought that you were gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.14,0:54:42.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, you know, eat my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.74,0:54:44.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, no, no, wait, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.01,0:54:46.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong? - Sid?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.91,0:54:48.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not now, Mom! I'm busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.31,0:54:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sid! Buzz, come on! - You left that door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.12,0:54:56.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get up! Use your legs! Fine! Let Sid trash you! But don't blame me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.36,0:55:00.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,It came! It finally came!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.93,0:55:05.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,"The Big One."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.97,0:55:10.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.07,0:55:13.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep out of reach of children."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.41,0:55:18.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cool! What am I gonna blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.01,0:55:21.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man. Hey, where's that wimpy cowboy doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.80,0:55:40.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. I've always wanted to put a spaceman into orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.81,0:55:52.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.32,0:55:59.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.86,0:56:04.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.53,0:56:11.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sid Phillips reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.60,0:56:13.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Launch of the shuttle has been delayed
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.74,0:56:16.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,due to adverse weather conditions at the launch site.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.64,0:56:19.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's forecast: Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.78,0:56:22.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.85,0:56:31.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I looked everywhere, honey, but all I could find was your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.69,0:56:33.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,But what if we leave them behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.86,0:56:35.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.49,0:56:38.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll find Woody and Buzz before we leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.40,0:56:46.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.37,0:56:48.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need air!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.50,0:56:50.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you quit movin' around?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.84,0:56:54.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's just that I get... I get so nervous before I travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.61,0:56:57.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did I get stuck with you as a moving buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.21,0:57:00.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone else was picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.92,0:57:06.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.29,0:57:12.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,If only you could see how much Andy misses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.07,0:57:27.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.38,0:57:38.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Get over here and see if you can get this toolbox. Off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.19,0:57:43.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Buzz, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.86,0:57:48.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, I can't do this without you. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.23,0:57:52.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't help. I can't help anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.67,0:57:55.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, sure you can, Buzz. You can get me outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.00,0:57:58.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then I'll get that rocket off you, and we'll make a break for Andy's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.04,0:58:02.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's house, Sid's house. What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.41,0:58:06.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Buzz. You've had a big fall. You must not be thinking clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.78,0:58:10.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Woody. For the first time I am thinking clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.19,0:58:13.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were right all along. I'm not a Space Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.82,0:58:17.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just a toy, a stupid, little, insignificant toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.73,0:58:19.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.73,0:58:22.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bein' a toy is a lot better than bein' a, a Space Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.56,0:58:24.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, right. - No, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.60,0:58:28.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, over in that house is a kid who thinks you are the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.34,0:58:30.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,And it's not because you're a Space Ranger, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.87,0:58:34.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's because you're a toy. You are his toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.74,0:58:36.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,But why would Andy want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.95,0:58:41.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would Andy want you? Look at you! You're a Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.45,0:58:44.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any other toy would give up his moving parts just to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.59,0:58:48.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got wings. You glow in the dark. You talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.29,0:58:51.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your helmet does that, that, that whoosh thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.73,0:58:55.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are a cool toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.27,0:59:01.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, you're too cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.77,0:59:04.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, I mean, what chance does a toy like me have
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.04,0:59:08.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,against a Buzz Lightyear action figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.41,0:59:11.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,All I can do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.08,0:59:15.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ There's a snake in my boots ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.58,0:59:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would Andy ever want to play with me
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.79,0:59:20.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,when he's got you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.76,0:59:25.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the one that should be strapped to that rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.17,0:59:37.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.85,0:59:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, Buzz, forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.15,0:59:54.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should get outta here while you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.83,1:00:07.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz? What are you doin'? I thought you were...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.40,1:00:10.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, sheriff. There's a kid over in that house who needs us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.44,1:00:12.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let's get you out of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.51,1:00:14.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:18.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Buzz. We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.65,1:00:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.15,1:00:26.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, it's the moving van.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.32,1:00:28.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta get outta here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.33,1:00:35.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.00,1:00:38.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.83,1:00:42.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, I'm out! - Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.44,1:00:49.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to ride the pony.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.65,1:00:58.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody? Woody? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.09,1:01:00.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.47,1:01:15.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Time for lift- off!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.64,1:01:20.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.38,1:01:32.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back, back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.29,1:01:34.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Down, down!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.59,1:01:36.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, what do I do? Come on, Woody. Think.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.99,1:01:42.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.50,1:01:45.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no! Wait! Wait. Listen, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.27,1:01:49.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a good toy down there, and he's gonna be blown to bits in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.44,1:01:52.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,All because of me. We gotta save him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.01,1:01:55.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,And... But I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.45,1:02:07.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.32,1:02:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,And he's the only one I've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.07,1:02:26.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Okay, I think I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.14,1:02:28.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to break a few rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.78,1:02:31.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,But if it works, it'll help everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.05,1:02:33.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.69,1:02:45.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Houston to Mission Control. Come in, Control.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.56,1:02:50.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Launch pad is being constructed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.23,1:02:51.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.80,1:02:54.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need Pump Boy here, Ducky here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.74,1:02:58.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Legs, you're with Ducky.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.64,1:03:00.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,RollerBob and I don't move 'til we get the signal. Clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.01,1:03:04.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.53,1:03:26.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wind the frog.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.72,1:03:50.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait for the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.24,1:04:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.15,1:04:13.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.25,1:04:15.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.38,1:04:17.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.79,1:04:19.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm coming. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.06,1:04:30.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Scud!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.50,1:04:36.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stupid dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.98,1:04:45.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lean back!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.25,1:04:54.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mission Control, is the launch pad construction complete?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.49,1:04:57.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roger. Rocket is now secured to guide wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.16,1:05:00.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are currently obtaining the ignition sticks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.46,1:05:01.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Countdown will commence momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.96,1:05:04.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stand by. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.33,1:05:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ma! Where are the matches? Oh, wait. Here they are. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.84,1:05:10.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! Great! Help me outta this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.50,1:05:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - It's okay. Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.68,1:05:17.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.01,1:05:23.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Houston. All systems are go. Requesting permission to launch...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.35,1:05:27.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey? How'd you get out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.49,1:05:31.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. You and I can have a cookout later.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.83,1:05:36.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Houston, do we have permission to launch?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.30,1:05:38.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roger. Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.80,1:05:43.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are confirmed at "T" minus ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.54,1:05:47.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,And counting. Ten, nine,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.31,1:05:50.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,eight, seven, six,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.14,1:05:53.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,five, four, three, two,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.08,1:05:57.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- one! - Reach for the sky!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.89,1:06:01.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,This town ain't big enough for the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.92,1:06:02.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.99,1:06:06.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody's poisoned the water hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.53,1:06:10.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's busted. - Who are you callin' busted buster?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.06,1:06:12.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.13,1:06:16.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you Sid Phillips.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.34,1:06:19.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't like bein' blown up Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.07,1:06:21.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,or smashed or ripped apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.14,1:06:24.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- "We"? - That's right! Your toys!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.41,1:06:26.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.85,1:06:29.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.12,1:06:32.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.34,1:06:55.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.58,1:07:00.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,From now on you must take good care of your toys!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.98,1:07:05.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't we'll find out Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.25,1:07:10.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,We toys can see everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.33,1:07:14.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,So play nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.13,1:07:24.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We did it! We did it! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.84,1:07:27.57,eng,2,0,0,0,,The toys! The toys are alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.64,1:07:29.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.08,1:07:34.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sid?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.78,1:07:37.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to play with Sally?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.58,1:07:40.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice work, fellows. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.35,1:07:43.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Comin' out of the ground, what a touch. That was a stroke of genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.29,1:07:46.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.39,1:07:47.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.80,1:07:51.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody say, "Bye, house!"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.83,1:07:54.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody! The van! - Bye, house.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.97,1:07:58.70,eng,2,0,0,0,,We gotta run! Thanks, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.11,1:08:03.13,eng,3,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.11,1:08:10.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just go. I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.37,1:08:31.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.64,1:08:32.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.72,1:08:50.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.39,1:08:54.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.89,1:08:56.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.57,1:09:03.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get away, you stupid dog! Down!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.90,1:09:06.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Down! - Hold on, Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.67,1:09:09.97,eng,2,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.91,1:09:13.50,eng,3,0,0,0,,Take care of Andy for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.58,1:09:15.10,eng,4,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.35,1:09:17.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.14,1:09:46.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are we there already?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.31,1:09:47.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - How did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.98,1:09:49.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How'd he get here? - Where have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.38,1:09:50.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.65,1:09:52.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's goin' on? - What's he takin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.89,1:09:54.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.05,1:09:56.78,eng,2,0,0,0,,Hey. What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.13,1:10:01.68,eng,3,0,0,0,,He's at it again!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.57,1:10:15.77,eng,4,0,0,0,,- Get him! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.05,1:10:25.21,eng,5,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.52,1:10:31.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no! Wait! Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.03,1:10:41.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pig pile!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.72,1:11:06.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get outta that car! - Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.29,1:11:10.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Please! You don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.36,1:11:12.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz is out there. We gotta help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.47,1:11:14.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - Toss him overboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.83,1:11:16.43,eng,2,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.04,1:11:21.10,eng,3,0,0,0,,- Hooray! - So long, Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.91,1:11:28.17,eng,4,0,0,0,,Oh! Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.22,1:11:31.65,eng,5,0,0,0,,- Oh! Well, thanks for the ride. - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.16,1:11:37.45,eng,6,0,0,0,,Now let's catch up to that truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.52,1:11:38.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.50,1:11:44.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.70,1:11:48.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys! Guys! Woody's riding R.C.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.47,1:11:50.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - And Buzz is with him!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.01,1:11:55.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.68,1:11:57.94,eng,2,0,0,0,,Woody was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.01,1:12:01.10,eng,3,0,0,0,,- What have we done? - Great! Now I have guilt.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.18,1:12:04.62,eng,4,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.68,1:12:08.68,eng,5,0,0,0,,Rocky, the ramp!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.79,1:12:10.69,eng,6,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.13,1:12:15.86,eng,7,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.36,1:12:19.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick! Hold onto my tail!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.54,1:12:29.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Attaboy, Slink! - Oh! Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.71,1:12:30.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! Speed up!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.04,1:12:34.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Speed up! - The batteries! They're runnin' out!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.45,1:12:43.15,eng,2,0,0,0,,∮ Hakuna Matata ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.22,1:12:45.55,eng,3,0,0,0,,∮ What a wonderful phrase ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.40,1:12:55.27,eng,4,0,0,0,,- I can't hold on much longer. - Slink! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.45,1:13:12.42,eng,5,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.49,1:13:15.89,eng,6,0,0,0,,Woody! The rocket!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:19.05,eng,7,0,0,0,,The match! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.13,1:13:21.15,eng,8,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sid!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.40,1:13:30.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.87,1:13:33.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.94,1:13:37.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.54,1:13:39.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,no!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.61,1:13:42.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.36,1:13:54.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody! What are you doing? - Hold still, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.43,1:13:57.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.50,1:13:59.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next stop. Andy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.73,1:14:03.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. I just lit a rocket. Rockets ex. Plode!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.81,1:14:16.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I should have held on longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.05,1:14:20.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look! Look! It's Woody and Buzz comin' up fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.69,1:14:23.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.50,1:14:32.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.57,1:14:42.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the part where we blow up!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.21,1:14:44.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not today!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.32,1:14:57.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buzz! You're flyin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.69,1:15:00.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't flying. This is falling with style.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.36,1:15:08.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.07,1:15:16.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, we missed the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.18,1:15:18.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not aiming for the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.05,1:15:26.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.15,1:15:28.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? What is it? - Woody! Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.25,1:15:30.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, great, you found them. Where were they?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.26,1:15:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Here in the car! - See?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.52,1:15:36.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, what'd I tell you? Right where you left 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.70,1:15:48.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Which one can I open first? - Let's let Molly open one.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.01,1:15:55.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frankincense this is Myrrh.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.75,1:15:57.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, heads up, everybody. It's show time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.88,1:16:00.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's time!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.92,1:16:03.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.49,1:16:05.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a less painful way to get my attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.89,1:16:09.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.09,1:16:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say, isn't that mistletoe?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.33,1:16:17.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe Andy will get another dinosaur. Like a leaf eater.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.40,1:16:20.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,That way I could play the dominant predator.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.81,1:16:22.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quiet, everyone! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.07,1:16:25.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Molly's first present is Mrs. Potato Head.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.74,1:16:27.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Repeat: A Mrs. Potato Head.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.91,1:16:29.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Idaho!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.95,1:16:32.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gee, I'd better shave.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.96,1:16:38.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in Frankincense.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.26,1:16:40.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy is now opening his first present.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.63,1:16:42.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's... - Buzz. Buzz Lightyear,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.59,1:16:45.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't quite... - you are not worried, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.23,1:16:46.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Me? No, no. - Make out...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.77,1:16:49.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.13,1:16:51.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,A large bo... It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.84,1:16:54.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you? - Now, Buzz,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.61,1:16:59.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,what could Andy possibly get that is worse than you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.85,1:17:01.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh what is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.21,1:17:04.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow! A puppy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.06,1:17:22.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.67,1:17:26.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.94,1:17:31.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ When the road looks rough ahead ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.18,1:17:36.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And you're miles and miles from your nice warm bed ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.18,1:17:39.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You just remember what your old pal said ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:42.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Boy you've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.86,1:17:47.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Yeah you've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.90,1:17:55.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.10,1:17:59.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.31,1:18:05.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You got troubles And I got 'em too ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.54,1:18:09.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ There isn't anything I wouldn't do for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.61,1:18:12.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ If we stick together we can see it through ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.72,1:18:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 'Cause you've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.86,1:18:20.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.19,1:18:26.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Some other folks might be a little bit smarter than I am ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.33,1:18:29.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Bigger and stronger too ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.37,1:18:30.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Maybe ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.54,1:18:36.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ But none of them will ever love you the way I do ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.21,1:18:38.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ It's me and you boy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.88,1:18:42.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And as the years go by ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.38,1:18:45.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Our friendship will never die ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.09,1:18:51.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You're gonna see it's our destiny ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.06,1:18:55.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.96,1:18:58.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.23,1:19:02.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ You've got a friend in me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,(酒馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:55.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,(旅馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:58.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,(悬赏,五十兆亿元)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:01.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家给我听好,这是抢劫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,通通都不准动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:04.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,(银行  杂货店)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,把猪扑满给我掏空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:11.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,钱钱钱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:14.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手,住手!你这可恶的蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:17.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴,宝贝,否则你的羊会遭殃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:19.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.61,0:01:23.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,别伤害我的羊,谁来帮帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:32.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向天空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟了,是胡迪警长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:37.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来阻止你的,独眼蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是我啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖乖跟我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:43.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你休想,警长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:46.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带了我那只,凶狠的斗犬来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:50.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带了我的恐龙,它专门吃凶狠的斗犬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:54.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要去坐牢了,蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:58.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟你老婆小孩说再见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:01:59.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,(监狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你又解救了危机,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我最喜欢的副警长
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:14.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,《玩具总动员》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:17.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 你什么也别愁 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:20.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,来,我们来抓牛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 道路坎坷困难多 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:26.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 要十万八千里才到家门口 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,牛仔,把他们围起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:31.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 你只要想起我在你左右 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:34.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我是你好朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,呀啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:37.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦对,我是你好朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:39.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 有些人比我能干比我强 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 身体健壮走起路雄赳赳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.06,0:02:47.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:48.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 也许 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:53.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 没有人能像我这样爱护你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 对你是毫无保留 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:57.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 多少的岁月中 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇!哇!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:03.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我们的命运紧相连 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:07.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我们的友谊更加深厚 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:10.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我是你好朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:12.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦对,我是你好朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,达阵得分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:19.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- ∮ 我是你好朋友 ∮ - ∮ 酷毙了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢吗? - 妈咪,这真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你喜欢就好,小寿星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,就跟我在店里看到的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好棒,好棒哦... - 希望能摆得下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:30.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一,二,三,四 - 哦，天哪，你有...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很好,这样应该就夠了 - 可以留到搬家吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 当然可以啰 - 好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:36.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,去抱茉莉,你的朋友马上就要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:40.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,派对要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:43.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,呀啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:48.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟的房间  闲人勿进)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:57.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人在水源区下了毒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:58.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,茉莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:00.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好重哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天哪,是今天开生日派对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:18.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,各位,已经安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我盒子上写得很清楚,适合三岁以上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:31.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么能叫我当,口水公主的临时褓姆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:45.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,火腿,你看!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是毕加索 - 我看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:53.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有文化的肥猪,看什么看啊!你这个大扁脸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:00.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 队长,看到弹簧狗没有 - 报告长官,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:03.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,谢了!稍息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:08.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿,胡迪,这次我要红的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不行,弹簧狗... - 好吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:12.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,那红的让给你好了,等一下,弹簧狗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:16.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我有一些坏消息 - 坏消息,嘘...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,去叫大家集合来开干部会议,装得开心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,装得开心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:25.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,要开干部会议,长蛇,机器人准备讲台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,画板,拔枪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:37.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你又赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:40.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,画板,你拔枪练得不错嘛,西部最快的神枪手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿要开干部会议了,来吧,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:46.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的那个呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:49.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁把我涂鸦板拿走的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:54.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抱抱龙,你好吗? - 你有没有被吓到?说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:57.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一次,我差一点就被你吓死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:06:00.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直想可怕一点,但是我老是没有灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:03.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是一个惹人厌的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,我想要谢谢你救了我的羊群
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:11.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:16.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我今天晚上另外找个人,替我看羊,你看怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个嘛,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:24.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了,要找我的话,我就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:26.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 呦啊嘿吼 - 快点,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,小的玩具到前面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:36.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,(组装玩具)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了,麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,太近了,退后...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 好了,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:47.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,试音,试音,清楚吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:51.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,大家都听到了吗?架子上面的听见吗?很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:54.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我们第一项议题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了!每个人都找到,搬家伙伴了没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 搬家伙伴?他不是说真的吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道我们要搬家了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:05.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要拉小手吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:07.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们以为,我在跟你们开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只剩下一个礼拜的时间,就要搬家了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:12.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不希望任何玩具被丢下来,两个人一组
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果还没有搬家伙伴,去找一个来!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:18.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,接下来...对了!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:22.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,星期二晚上,我们开的塑胶老化大会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为呢,非常的成功
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要感谢拼字先生,为我们所做的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:30.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你,拼字先生 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:34.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了!对了,还有一件小事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:37.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟的生日派对,改到今天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:38.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来我们要讨论的是...什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:41.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会改成今天呢?下个礼拜才是他的生日啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼?安弟的妈咪头壳坏去了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:48.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,很显然安弟的妈咪,希望在搬家之前开一个派对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不担心,你们也不需要担心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:53.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪当然不担心了,安弟从幼稚园开始,就最喜欢他了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:56.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,蛋头先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:59.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果胡迪说不用担心,那么我绝对不会担心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:02.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪以前从来没有弄错过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:06.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,各位,每年圣诞节,和生日我们都熬过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:09.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是如果安弟有了新恐龙呢,很凶狠的那一种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我是绝对受不了,被抛弃的打击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着!没有人可以取代我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:16.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们讨论的重点是安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:20.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们和安弟玩,多少次并不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,重要的是安弟需要我们的时候,我们都在他身边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:28.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,那才是我们当玩具的目的,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:32.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起哦,我很不想打断会议,但是...他们来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:34.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,客人在三点钟方向
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:37.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:41.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,会议结束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:44.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天!你们有没有看到那些礼物?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:46.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:52.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们绝对会是,下个月车库拍卖的货品了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有没有恐龙形状的礼物啊? - 哦,谢谢你大声哭出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:59.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜托,礼物都在盒子里!白痴 - 礼物越来越大了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:01.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一等,那里有个小件的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们完了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:13.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我派部队出去的话,你们能安静下来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 能,能,我们保证 - 好,省省电池吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:19.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,帅哟,胡迪,这一招真有效
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:26.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,立刻派侦察队到楼下,紧急状况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你知道该怎么做 - 是,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:31.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,各位,你们都听到了,紧急状况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:34.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,重复,紧急状况,侦察计划开始执行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:35.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,快...快...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:36.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,(绿色奇兵)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:58.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:00.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,小朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的人都到客厅来,准备要拆礼物了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:31.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,有了这玩意儿,我们就可以知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些礼物是什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:40.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,谁的肚子饿了?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,洋芋片在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:45.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,有原味还有烤肉口味的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!怎么搞的?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:50.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还以为他收拾干净了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:53.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不是该到了吗?怎么会那么久?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:57.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们可是训练有素,最优秀的军人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:59.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,放心啦,他们并没有躺着偷懒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧,别管我了!快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:15.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个好军人,绝对不会丢下战友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:35.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,小朋友,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:38.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都坐好,好了,小朋友,快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:42.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,围成圈圈坐下来,不,安弟,你要坐中间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:45.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,好,你想先拆哪一个礼物呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:49.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的 - 他们在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:52.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,大鸟妈妈请回答,这是B队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:55.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大鸟妈妈请回答 - 有消息了,大家安静
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:58.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,安弟正在拆第一个礼物了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:01.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,蛋头太太,蛋头太太...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:03.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,做白日梦又不犯法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:06.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,缎带被解开了,他正在拆包装纸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:08.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是...那是...那是一个便当盒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是一个便当盒 - 便当盒?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 便当盒 - 午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:15.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,第二个礼物,那看起来是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:18.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一件床单 - 那小子谁请来的呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,只剩下一个了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:28.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好,接着是最后一个礼物了 - 最后一个了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个礼物很大,那...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是棋盘游戏 - 重复,是海战棋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 耶 好的 - 小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:39.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,蛋头老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:43.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,任务完成了,干得好,收工了,我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就说吧,没什么好担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:49.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早就知道你是对,胡迪,我从来没有怀疑过你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:52.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:55.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么啊? - 等一下!再把对讲机打开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:58.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,大鸟妈妈请回答,大鸟妈妈请回答
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪从柜子里拿出礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟正在拆,他看到这个礼物很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:05.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈咪,这是什么? - 是个很大的盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,有一个孩子挡住我的视线,我看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那...那是... - 喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么啊?是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:18.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 惨了 - 你这只蠢蜥蜴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:21.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们永远不知道那是什么了 - 看你干得好事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,不对,不对,转过去,转过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:26.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不对,不对,放反了,你们把它们放反了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:30.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,正是阳极,负是阴极,我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:32.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,到我的房间来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:35.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,紧急状况,紧急状况,安弟要上楼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:37.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 搞定了 - 儿童入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,重复,立刻回到自己岗位上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:41.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟来了,快回到自己的位置上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,快回到自己的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的耳朵,我的耳朵呢?有谁看到我的耳朵?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:50.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开,让开,我来了,我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:03.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看,他的雷射亮了,帮我拿一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:06.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,就摆在这里,这里是太空船降落的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:09.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还是空手道高手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:12.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,小朋友下来吧,玩游戏啰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:28.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么东东? - 你看得到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:32.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那上面的东西是什么? - 胡迪,谁跟你在上面啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:38.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在床底下干什么啊? - 没什么,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:41.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想安弟有一点太兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,大概是吃了太多冰淇淋跟蛋糕,那只是个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.85,0:14:47.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个意外,正坐在你的地盘上,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:50.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你被人取代了吗? - 我刚刚是怎么告诉你的?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人可以取代我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,不管那上面是什么,我们都要给他来一个...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:15:00.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,礼貌的热情的,安弟房间式的欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:16.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,(太空骑警巴斯光年雷射)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年呼叫星际总部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到了请回答
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:32.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,星际总部,请回答,你们有没有收到?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:35.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们为什么不回答?我的太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:38.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,(巴斯光年)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟糕,要花好久才能修好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:45.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年任务日志,星际日期4072年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:48.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的太空船,在第十二区脱离轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:51.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我坠落在一个奇怪的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定是被,巨大的撞击惊醒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:58.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里的地形似乎有点不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,目前还没有,能不能呼吸空气的读数
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:05.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且也看不出来,有智慧型生命的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:06.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:08.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:11.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我吓到你了吗?我不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:14.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,你好,我叫胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:18.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,而这里呢,是安弟的房间,请恕我直言
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定是搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:23.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我的地盘,而这张床...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,当地的执法人员,你早该来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是巴斯光年,保护宇宙小组的太空骑警
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:31.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的太空船意外坠机了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:34.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,是呀,这是一个意外,因为这张床是我的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要修理我的涡轮推进器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:39.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们现在是用旧燃料,还是已经有结晶体溶解物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:41.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想想...我们有三号电池
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心,站住,什么人?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开枪,没事,是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你认识这些生物吗? - 认识,他们是安弟的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:52.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,你们可以上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:55.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是巴斯光年,和平使者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:59.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好高兴,你不是恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:01.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:04.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们热情的欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:07.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那个按钮是干什么的? - 我来示范
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:09.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年拯救宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪也有那样的东西,他的是拉线的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.93,0:17:15.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只是... - 只是听起来像被车子,压过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:19.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,不像这个,这个是高品质声音系统
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,配线可能是铜线哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:24.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了,你从哪里来的?新加坡?香港?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:28.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,事实上我是驻扎在,第四区域的伽玛象限
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:31.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是宇宙保护小组
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,太空警备队的队员
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:35.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保护我们的星际,免于受到札克天王的入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:39.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保护我们的星际,免于受到札克天王的入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?我来自儿乐宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:45.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我来自美泰儿,其实我并不是来自美泰儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来自比较小的公司,结果被美泰儿收购了,我想...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:51.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,一群土包子,没看过新玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:55.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,你看看他身上的小东西,比瑞士刀还要多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:18:00.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,被我的雷射击中可不是好玩的,嘿,雷射?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么会没有雷射呢?胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:06.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是雷射,那只是会闪的灯泡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:08.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他怎么了? - 嫉妒雷射
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:09.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:12.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们对安弟的新玩具,都印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:15.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 玩具 - TOY玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:19.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,我想你用的字应该是太空骑警
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:24.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要用的字现在不能说,因为有学龄前的玩具在场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有点紧张了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:28.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯先生,我很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:31.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个太空骑警都做些什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:33.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不是太空骑警
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:37.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不会打击邪恶,发射雷射,也不会飞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,打个岔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,好赞的机翼哦,酷毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:48.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,什么嘛?这些是塑胶,他才不会飞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:51.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是碳化合金,而且我的确会飞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:54.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,你不会 - 会,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:56.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不会 - 会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会,不会,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算我闭着眼睛,也可以飞遍整个房间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:04.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好啊,泡泡头先生,证明吧 - 那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:06.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位请退后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:17.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:46.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我会飞 - 哇!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:49.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你飞得有夠炫的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:53.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我找到搬家伙伴了 - 谢谢,谢谢你们,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:57.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不叫飞行,那只是摔得很好看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:20:00.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,小妞们一定迷死你了,教教我好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:04.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 刚刚那一招真是太酷了 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:05.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,再过几天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:08.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里就会恢复老样子了,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:10.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,不信你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:13.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是安弟最爱的玩具,我还是安弟最爱的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:16.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我现在高高在上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:18.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 样样事都享受现成 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:20.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,(ABC牛仔竞技秀)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:23.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我现在的光景 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:26.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 想要什么都行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 忽然间从天外飞过来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:33.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 一颗要爆发的炸弹 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:39.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 从此我发现,一些奇怪的事要发生 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年拯救宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪的... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:45.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,(我要你加入太空骑警)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 事情发生在我身上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,(飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:53.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 事情... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 真奇怪 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:56.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,(飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:21:01.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪的事情发生在我身上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 这是毫无疑问的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.19,0:21:09.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,(巴斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:14.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我曾拥有许多朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:17.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 现在一个也不剩 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:21.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我叫他们 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 他们对我是冷冰冰的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:27.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我曾有特权 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我曾被重视 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:32.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 但好景不常 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:34.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我失去我最喜欢的人... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:37.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 的关爱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:42.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我告诉你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:45.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪的事发生在我身上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:50.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:52.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 的事情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:59.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪的事发生在我身上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.31,0:22:01.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 这是毫无疑问的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.45,0:22:08.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.09,0:22:10.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 的事情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:14.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 奇怪... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:16.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 的事情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.33,0:22:20.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于重见天日了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.34,0:22:23.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的帽子在哪里啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家好,我是胡迪,大家好,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.81,0:22:32.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱抱龙,弹簧狗,我给你们看样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:35.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好像被你们给同化了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:38.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们老大安弟,把他的名字刻在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇赛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.75,0:22:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,还用奇异笔耶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:45.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,我要回去修我的太空船了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:50.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,不要让他影乡到你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:52.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么?什么意思?谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:55.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道安弟很喜欢巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:59.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是你在他的心目当中,一直占有一席之地的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.51,0:23:03.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是啊,是块畸零地 - 好了,我受夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,单向的细长连结带
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯先生要胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.82,0:23:14.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,泡泡头,你最好离安弟远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:18.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是我的,没有人可以拆散他跟我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:19.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:22.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的连结带呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:25.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,从现在开始,少再说什么太空的事,那快把我逼疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:31.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,不高兴可以向,星际总部申诉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:35.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,我看你是,敬酒不吃吃罚酒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:39.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 警长,不要无理取闹 - 是吗?硬汉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.76,0:23:53.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里的空气没有毒嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:57.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么可以在一个,不知名的星球上打开我的头盔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:24:01.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的眼球很可能被吸出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:05.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的以为...你就是太空人巴斯光年吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.77,0:24:08.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直以为你只是装模作样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,快来看,他是真的巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:14.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在讽刺我,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.11,0:24:16.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是啦...巴斯,有外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.95,0:24:18.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:21.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:28.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,是阿薛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:34.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准动
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:35.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还以为他去夏令营呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:37.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定是被踢出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.57,0:24:40.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪,怎么又是他营
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.17,0:24:41.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,炮弹来袭!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.21,0:24:46.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这回又是谁啊营 - 我...我看不清楚是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.85,0:24:48.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷尼呢? - 我在这儿,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:53.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我受不了残忍的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.22,0:24:56.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪!是战斗兵卡卡'而
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:24:57.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:25:01.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不关你们太空人的事,是我们玩具自己的事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.16,0:25:02.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,最好让我看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.83,0:25:06.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个阿兵哥,为什么绑着爆炸装置?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.27,0:25:08.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为那个...阿薛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.97,0:25:11.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的毛还真多
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.87,0:25:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是,那是阿德,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.04,0:25:16.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,他才是阿薛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.61,0:25:19.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那个天真的小孩? - 他才不天真呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.85,0:25:23.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,折磨那些玩具是他的最爱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.35,0:25:28.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看我们必须想个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.92,0:25:30.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?快下来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:33.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要给那孩子一个教训 - 是啊,好,尽管去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.03,0:25:36.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,用你吓人的雷射溶化他
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心,别乱碰,那是非常危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.80,0:25:42.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,点火了,他点火了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.07,0:25:45.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,趴下来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶,死了,他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:55.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来可以阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.25,0:25:58.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,我很想看看你的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.52,0:26:01.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我更想看看,你要怎么去当烈士
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.45,0:26:04.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,真希望立刻就能搬家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.89,0:26:06.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:10.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,(待售梦幻房地产  出售)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:14.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向浩瀚宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.27,0:26:17.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,打包完了肚子好饿哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.00,0:26:20.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的晚餐就去...比萨星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.94,0:26:23.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,比萨星球!哦酷
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:27.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,去洗手,我替茉莉换衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.31,0:26:30.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我可以带玩具去吗? - 你只能带一个玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.32,0:26:33.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只能带一个啊 - 一个玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.09,0:26:40.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟会选我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.80,0:26:43.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,(别作梦)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.93,0:26:45.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,别作梦,不是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,巴斯,巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.82,0:27:12.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年,老天爷,我们有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.53,0:27:15.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 麻烦,在哪儿? - 下面,就在下面!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.37,0:27:18.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个无助的玩具,它被困住了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:20.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我立刻去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.98,0:27:27.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么都没有耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.74,0:27:29.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在那下面,再找找
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.05,0:27:31.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,他长什么样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:52.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.54,0:27:55.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,他没有摔在车道上耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.41,0:27:59.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我猜他弹到阿薛的院子了 - 巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.41,0:28:05.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,遥控车好像有话要说,什么事,老弟?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.78,0:28:09.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他是说这件事情并不是意外 - 什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.22,0:28:11.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯是被推出去的 - 不是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.62,0:28:12.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,是胡迪推的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:15.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.12,0:28:17.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你...你不会以为我是故意,把巴斯推出窗外吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.19,0:28:19.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吧,蛋头?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.73,0:28:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该叫我蛋头先生,你这暗箭伤人的凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.63,0:28:27.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,拜托你们...你们一定要相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.74,0:28:30.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们相信你,胡迪,对吧,抱抱龙?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.97,0:28:33.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个...我不喜欢跟人家对质
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:37.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的荣誉到哪儿去了?你真的是军人的一大耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.31,0:28:39.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你根本不配对我们发号施令
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:42.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,受不了巴斯光年占去你的时间,对吧,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.39,0:28:46.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你无法面对巴斯可能成为,安弟最喜欢的玩具这件事实
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:47.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你想要除掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:50.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果安弟花很多时间和我玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.73,0:28:53.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也要把我丢到窗外吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.13,0:28:55.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能让他胡作非为
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.10,0:28:56.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在那里,丢手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.93,0:28:58.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,用他的拉绳把他绑起来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.70,0:29:01.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要他的帽子 - 你们快住手好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.17,0:29:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.64,0:29:04.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...等等...我可以解释,安弟,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.97,0:29:08.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,我马上就来,我要去拿巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.14,0:29:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.85,0:29:16.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪,你有没有看到巴斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.79,0:29:17.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有,我没有看到
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:23.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安弟,我要出门啰 - 但是我找不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.79,0:29:26.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,儿子,先拿别的玩具,快走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.33,0:29:28.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:36.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我找不到巴斯,我明明放在桌上的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.91,0:29:40.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖乖,他一定还在那儿,你会找到他的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.89,0:29:56.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,太短了,我们还需要连环猴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.69,0:29:59.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经没有了!整桶都倒光了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.93,0:30:03.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,这些连环猴不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:07.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会再想其他的办法的,保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.27,0:30:09.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,他到底在哪里啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.57,0:30:12.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,(恐龙加油站)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:19.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,(汽油)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.22,0:30:24.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我来帮忙加油 - 好啊,我还能让你开车呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.32,0:30:26.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗? - 对,等你满十六岁
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.09,0:30:28.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,真讨厌,妈咪又在骗人家
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.62,0:30:33.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊!我要怎么说服那些傢伙,那只是个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.40,0:30:38.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.53,0:30:42.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯!你还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.61,0:30:45.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,太棒了,我有救了!我有救了!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:48.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟会发现你,他会带我们两个回房间
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:53.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后你就可以告诉每一个人,这只是一个天大的误会
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.85,0:30:56.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,对吧?伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.79,0:31:00.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是要让你知道,虽然你一直想要毁灭我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.32,0:31:03.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是在我们的星球,并不鼓励我们复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.19,0:31:07.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那很好 - 但这里不是我的星球,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.20,0:31:08.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.87,0:31:17.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,你来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.24,0:31:19.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要拆了我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:28.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴...巴斯光年拯救宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.65,0:31:31.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 下一站 - 比萨星球,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.09,0:31:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.90,0:31:47.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不知道我不在车上吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.87,0:31:50.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊,我被遗弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.08,0:31:54.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是个没人要的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.08,0:32:00.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年任务日志
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长跟我似乎在一个,很巨大的燃料补给站
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.15,0:32:05.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.98,0:32:28.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 根据我的导航电脑... - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.61,0:32:31.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给我闭嘴,白痴 - 警长,现在没有时间惊慌
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.05,0:32:35.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在是惊慌的好时机,我被遗弃了,安弟走了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.55,0:32:38.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们再过两天就要搬家了,这全是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.09,0:32:41.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我...我的错,如果你一开始,没有把我推出窗外...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.19,0:32:42.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:45.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,如果不是你,坐着那艘笨太空船出现
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.46,0:32:47.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,并且抢走,原来属于我的东西的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.66,0:32:49.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能怪到我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.33,0:32:52.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是因为你,使整个宇宙的安全受到危险
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.60,0:32:54.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?你在说什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:57.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是现在,札克天王在银河系边缘
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.77,0:32:59.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,秘密建立了一种武器
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个玩意儿,足以毁灭整个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.55,0:33:06.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有我有资料,可以击破这武器唯一的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:09.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你,朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.39,0:33:12.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是你耽误了,我跟星际总部会合的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.06,0:33:16.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个玩具!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.33,0:33:18.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是真的巴斯光年!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.66,0:33:23.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你...只是个会动的玩具,只是给小朋友玩的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个可悲又奇怪的人,我很同情你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.24,0:33:29.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.41,0:33:32.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?走啊,疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:35.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟星际总部会合个头啦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.88,0:33:38.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 加油小弟 - 你在叫我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.38,0:33:41.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错,你能帮我吗? - 比萨星球?安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.58,0:33:43.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道卡廷大道在哪里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.32,0:33:44.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.82,0:33:47.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有巴斯我没有脸回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.99,0:33:50.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯,巴斯,快回来 - 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.99,0:33:54.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你一定要回来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.46,0:33:55.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,(比萨星球)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.97,0:33:58.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我找到一艘太空船了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.64,0:34:01.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,一艘太空船,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:07.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,老兄,快一点,这些比萨会凉掉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.21,0:34:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 卡廷大道? - 对,在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.95,0:34:13.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,你确定这个太空运输机,送完了货物之后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.05,0:34:16.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,就会回到原来太空站吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.45,0:34:20.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,等到了那里以后,我们再来想个办法送你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.02,0:34:24.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好,那我们上船吧 - 等等...巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.66,0:34:26.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们到车后面,那里不会被人发现
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.73,0:34:30.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,货舱里没有安全设备,那是载货的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.13,0:34:32.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在机舱里比较安全 - 对,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.37,0:34:34.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯!巴斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:36.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,先左转两次,然后再右转,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.31,0:34:39.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你的帮忙,谢了 - 嗯,记住它,孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.31,0:34:40.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:56.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,在机舱比在货舱里安全,真是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.28,0:35:15.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,(比萨星球)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.75,0:35:23.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一班前往比萨星球的,高速接驳专车
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.39,0:35:26.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,正在倒数计时中
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.73,0:35:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.99,0:35:33.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到比萨星球
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.80,0:35:35.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,(开启舱门)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.20,0:35:37.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,白色区域是快速比萨外带区...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.60,0:35:38.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.67,0:35:42.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长?你在这儿呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.91,0:35:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,入口守备很森严,我们必须想办法进去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.08,0:35:48.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,好主意,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.68,0:35:51.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.51,0:35:54.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以进去了,欢迎来到比萨星球
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:56.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.45,0:35:59.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,舱门就要关了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.49,0:36:02.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,琼斯一家人,一共五个人,你的接驳车正在发射台十二号
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.66,0:36:04.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈,我们可以去换代币吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.69,0:36:06.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,走路小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.96,0:36:08.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:18.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,十,九,八,七,六...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.74,0:36:22.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,五,四,三...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.44,0:36:24.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,二,一
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.58,0:36:28.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,好棒的太空船哦,干得好,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.15,0:36:30.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,(星球杀手)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.29,0:36:32.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,(外星怪物)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.39,0:36:36.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,(棒打外星人)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.29,0:36:39.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪,我能玩黑洞吗?拜托...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:41.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安弟! - 我们要去找一艘
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.40,0:36:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 到十二区的太空船 - 等一下,巴斯,往这边
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.43,0:36:47.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那边有一艘特别的船 - 它有超高动力吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.07,0:36:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,超高的启动动力
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.47,0:36:53.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有太空...驱动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.81,0:36:56.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在哪里?我没有看到... - 这,这
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.61,0:36:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,太空船!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.75,0:36:59.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,(钓娃娃准备发射台)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.88,0:37:03.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,巴斯,准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.12,0:37:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就快要好了 - 等我一说"上"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.59,0:37:07.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就跳到篮子里,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.52,0:37:09.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,(奖品)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.79,0:37:11.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不好了 - 妈,如果我把比萨都吃光
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.36,0:37:12.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能不能给我外星黏液?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.53,0:37:15.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怎么会碰上这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.14,0:37:27.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 陌生人 - 他来自外面
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:32.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们好!我是巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.11,0:37:35.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,和平的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.02,0:37:39.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你今天离开前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.92,0:37:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,请用一片腊肠比萨补充能源,现在请从三号柜台登机
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.19,0:37:46.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是星际紧急事件
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:49.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要征召你们的船到第十二区
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.26,0:37:51.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里谁负责?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.83,0:37:54.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,是爪子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.14,0:37:57.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,爪子是我们的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.57,0:38:00.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,爪子会选择谁留下来谁离开
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.17,0:38:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这太荒谬了 - 过份,这什么烂机器嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.71,0:38:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶,欠扁
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.25,0:38:10.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟了,阿薛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.12,0:38:11.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,快趴下来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.42,0:38:13.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,(任务指挥中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.42,0:38:14.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长,你怎么了,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.96,0:38:16.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你自己决定爬上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.89,0:38:20.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,爪子!它动了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我被选中了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:30.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了,我的朋友,我要去更好玩的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.17,0:38:32.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.24,0:38:37.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.73,0:38:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.33,0:38:57.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,不!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:00.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.30,0:39:03.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他被选中了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.37,0:39:05.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他一定得走 - 嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.44,0:39:07.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要触怒爪子 - 你们在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:09.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,放手,放手!你们这些疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.41,0:39:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,棒呆了!双重大奖!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:20.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们回家去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.74,0:39:37.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长,我看到你家了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:39.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你就快到家了 - 神秘之门快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.17,0:39:41.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 通往极乐世界 - 拜托你闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.71,0:39:43.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个根本不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:46.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要进了阿薛家,一辈子都别想出来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.65,0:39:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿德,好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.65,0:39:51.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐下来,好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.75,0:39:55.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我有东西要给你 - 不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.96,0:39:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,预备,咬!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.63,0:40:03.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉娜!汉娜!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.10,0:40:05.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛? - 你有没有看到我的包裹?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.43,0:40:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你不知道是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:09.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.34,0:40:13.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 糟了,汉娜,你看珍妮 - 干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.31,0:40:15.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她病了 - 她才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.31,0:40:17.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要马上帮她动个手术
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.58,0:40:20.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 阿薛,把她还给我 - 不,不要进阿薛的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.35,0:40:22.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿薛,把她还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.45,0:40:24.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿薛!阿薛!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.92,0:40:28.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,护士,我们这里有一个病辜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备动手术,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.39,0:40:34.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,病人准备好啰
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.20,0:40:40.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,以前从来没有人,动过脑袋移植的手术
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.04,0:40:44.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种手术很困难,钳子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.64,0:40:47.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想那个孩子,应该没有上过医学院吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.14,0:40:51.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生,你成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.81,0:40:52.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,(我超爱爆裂物)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.95,0:40:55.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:58.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮现在好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.15,0:41:01.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈,阿薛弄坏我的娃娃 - 她说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.49,0:41:04.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管她说什么都不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.43,0:41:11.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,(死灵石怪)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.20,0:41:16.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,(杀手保罗)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.17,0:41:18.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们死定了,我要离开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.04,0:41:25.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,锁住了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.35,0:41:27.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定还有别的出口
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.99,0:41:42.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,那是你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.94,0:41:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,小傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.11,0:41:57.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,出来啊!你知道出去的路吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.81,0:42:28.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴...巴斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.86,0:42:42.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会自相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.19,0:42:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,求救,求救
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.43,0:42:49.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,星际总部请回答,请派后援部队
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.73,0:42:52.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,星际总部,收到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.60,0:42:55.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的雷射枪,最大威力可以杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.17,0:42:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,好极了,如果有人攻击的话,你可以闪灯把他们闪死
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:04.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,我找到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.65,0:43:07.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,是你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.42,0:43:09.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,咪咪,拜托你走开好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.72,0:43:12.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你千扰到我们的搜救任务了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.02,0:43:15.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看,他们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.23,0:43:22.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪,你看到胡迪没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.73,0:43:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你最后把他放在哪儿? - 就在车上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.53,0:43:28.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定在的,只是你没好好找而已
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.97,0:43:30.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不在车上,胡迪不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.31,0:43:33.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪不见了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.54,0:43:35.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是的,那黄鼠狼逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.78,0:43:38.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早说他有罪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.08,0:43:42.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁也没有想到,他会做出这么可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.12,0:43:46.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗,我希望他没事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.46,0:43:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,有生还者,叛军的基地在哪儿,说!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.60,0:43:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的意志力很坚强嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.60,0:44:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我们有很多办法,让你乖乖招供
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.81,0:44:17.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的叛军朋友在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.62,0:44:20.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿薛,你的点心好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.15,0:44:22.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.63,0:44:36.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?我真以你为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.07,0:44:38.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,一般人被这样折磨早就招了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.84,0:44:42.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望不会留下疤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.11,0:44:44.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是没有星际总部的消息,我们离太空站不远了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.81,0:44:47.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那扇门...没关好,我们自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.88,0:44:50.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪,我们不知道外面有什么 - 我会告诉你...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.15,0:44:54.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们要吃我们,巴斯,快想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.76,0:44:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,遮住眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:45:01.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,奇怪了,我离开前才充的电,应该能发射...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.83,0:45:05.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个白痴,你只是个玩具,用你的空手道打他们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.33,0:45:07.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走开 - 你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.87,0:45:10.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 退后,野蛮人让开
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.97,0:45:14.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪,放手 - 抱歉,各位,不陪你们玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.98,0:45:18.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以回家了,我们可以回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.55,0:45:19.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.16,0:45:36.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你再搞这种把戏会害死我们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.03,0:45:39.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不用你来教我该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.25,0:46:01.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.56,0:46:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得让这火车启动了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.53,0:46:08.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,快分散开来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.89,0:46:33.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,呼叫巴斯光年,巴斯光年请回答
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.75,0:46:35.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是星际总部
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.56,0:46:39.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 星际总部 - 巴斯光年,你收到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.06,0:46:42.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年,目前地球需要你的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.36,0:46:44.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 出动了 - 巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.87,0:46:48.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,全世界最棒的超级英雄,现在是全世界最棒的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.04,0:46:51.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯应有尽有,手腕锁定通讯器
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.94,0:46:54.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 呼叫巴斯光年 - 还会空手道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.74,0:46:57.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 超强雷射光束
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.44,0:46:59.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 彻底的消灭 - 多段式声音模拟器
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.01,0:47:05.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一个未知的宇宙,有秘密任务
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.19,0:47:07.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有最酷的高速飞翼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.96,0:47:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠 - 不是飞行玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.73,0:47:13.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,拥有巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.89,0:47:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你就能拯救邻近的星际 - 巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.43,0:47:20.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾卡而玩具,各大百货公司均有出售
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.00,0:47:23.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.70,0:47:24.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,(台湾制造)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.41,0:47:31.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 月亮伴着我航行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.78,0:47:34.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 穿越过星星 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.88,0:47:40.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 乘着银色的小船 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.49,0:47:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 在那短暂的梦境 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.73,0:47:47.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我现在知道自己是谁 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:51.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我能说得尽 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:54.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 你是玩具,你不会飞 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.47,0:48:00.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我在记忆里航行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.21,0:48:04.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦不 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.15,0:48:13.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 不是这样 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.42,0:48:16.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我能飞,假如我愿意 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:19.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 想像鸟在天空 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.19,0:48:22.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 自由的去飞翔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.26,0:48:25.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 去飞翔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.47,0:48:28.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.02,0:48:47.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.79,0:48:52.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 不能再去... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.66,0:48:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 航行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.21,0:49:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈,你有没有看到我的莎莉娃娃?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.28,0:49:14.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.02,0:49:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.59,0:49:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,安全了吗?巴斯,你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.56,0:49:31.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一个未知的宇宙有秘密任务,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.17,0:49:35.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?好有意思喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.24,0:49:37.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要喝点茶吗?纳斯比太太
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.74,0:49:39.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.81,0:49:42.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,临时邀请你,你还能来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.51,0:49:46.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 糟了 - 好可爱的帽子,纳斯比太太
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.48,0:49:48.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你戴起来真好看
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.58,0:49:52.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,汉娜,汉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.09,0:49:54.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈,失陪了,小姐们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.99,0:49:57.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.46,0:50:03.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈,什么事?妈,你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.43,0:50:06.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,巴斯,你还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.33,0:50:09.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,完了,全都完了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.57,0:50:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,全都完了,再见,拜拜!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.37,0:50:13.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.51,0:50:16.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,前一分钟你还在捍卫全宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.38,0:50:20.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,突然间,你就跟路易十六的王妃
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.91,0:50:23.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有她的妹妹,坐在一起喝下午茶
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:27.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你今天,大概是茶喝得太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.89,0:50:29.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,快起来,跟我走吧,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.89,0:50:32.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗?看到帽子没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.89,0:50:37.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是纳斯比太太 - 清醒一点,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.50,0:50:43.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我...我很抱歉,你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.80,0:50:45.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是有一点沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.80,0:50:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以熬过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.47,0:50:50.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是个冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.51,0:50:52.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安静,巴斯 - 看看我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.28,0:50:54.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我甚至没有办法飞出窗外
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.81,0:50:59.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是...这个帽子很好看,告诉我这个帽子很好看
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.28,0:51:01.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞出窗外！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.19,0:51:03.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.42,0:51:05.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,快,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.52,0:51:08.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,几年的辛苦训练全浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.46,0:51:10.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,是B3
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.76,0:51:12.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,没中!G6
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.77,0:51:15.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你猜对了,你是不是在偷看?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.27,0:51:18.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要啰嗦了,快交出来,不...不要耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.64,0:51:21.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把鼻子给我,快点 - 五战三胜怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.51,0:51:26.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位!各位!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.21,0:51:28.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的老天爷,是胡迪 - 他在那个疯子的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.55,0:51:31.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨! - 大伙儿,是胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.82,0:51:32.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪 - 真的假的?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.95,0:51:35.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪 - 我们要离开这儿了,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.02,0:51:38.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.83,0:51:44.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们看 - 胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.63,0:51:46.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天,真高兴看到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.57,0:51:49.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我就知道你会回来 - 你在那边做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.30,0:51:51.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,说来话长,宝贝,待会儿再说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.67,0:51:53.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,来,接好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.84,0:51:57.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我接到了 - 他接到了,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.41,0:52:00.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,弹簧狗,快点找个东西绑在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.38,0:52:02.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等...我有更好的点子,别听他的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.95,0:52:04.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿! - 蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.38,0:52:06.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们今天是不是,都吃了笨蛋药了?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.19,0:52:08.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们难道忘了,他是怎么对付巴斯的?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.25,0:52:10.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他回来这好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.32,0:52:14.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...你...你全都误会了,蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.59,0:52:16.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯很好,巴斯在这儿跟我在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.03,0:52:20.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是一个骗子 - 不,我不是,巴斯,快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.40,0:52:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉那些好心的玩具,你...你并没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.11,0:52:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉那些好心的玩具,你...你并没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.24,0:52:32.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,快来助我一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.78,0:52:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很幽默,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.15,0:52:37.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是认真的 - 胡迪,你到哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.72,0:52:39.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,他骗人,巴斯不在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.79,0:52:42.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,嗨,巴斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.06,0:52:46.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友都在对面,怎么不打个招呼呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.26,0:52:49.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨!各位,飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.76,0:52:51.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看是巴斯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.63,0:52:56.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,我们让好朋友们看看,我们刚刚学会的握手方式
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.07,0:52:58.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,来拍个手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.20,0:52:59.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,有点儿可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.04,0:53:02.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看我们现在是好朋友了,对吗,巴斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.57,0:53:04.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,给我个拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.58,0:53:07.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天啊,我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.11,0:53:08.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,看,那是巴斯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.01,0:53:11.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把那玩意儿给我,蛋头 - 你先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.82,0:53:14.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你到底想干什么啊? - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.79,0:53:20.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真恶心耶 - 凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.79,0:53:23.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,不... - 杀人凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.16,0:53:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 事情不是这样,我发誓 - 留着对陪审团说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.53,0:53:27.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望阿薛挖出你的声音盒,浑球
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.80,0:53:30.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...不要走,不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.14,0:53:32.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你...你们得帮帮我们,你们不知道这里是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.91,0:53:34.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,没什么好看的了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.71,0:53:37.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,回去玩我们的吧,好戏演完
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.28,0:53:39.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,回来!弹簧狗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.38,0:53:43.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗,拜托,拜托你听听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.78,0:53:47.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.15,0:53:50.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.36,0:54:01.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯!走开!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.17,0:54:02.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些恶心的怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.27,0:54:06.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些食人族快退后,快让开!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.81,0:54:15.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还活着,你们休想吃掉他,怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.11,0:54:16.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.38,0:54:21.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们把你修好了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.69,0:54:26.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是...他们是食人族
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:30.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们看到他们吃别的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.67,0:54:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我...我还以为你们想...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.14,0:54:42.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,...吃我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.74,0:54:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,别走!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.01,0:54:46.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 阿薛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.91,0:54:48.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,妈,我有事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.31,0:54:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 阿薛 - 巴斯,快点起来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.12,0:54:56.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你快起来,好吧,阿薛把你给拆了,可别怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.36,0:55:00.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,寄来了,终于寄来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.93,0:55:05.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,大飞弹
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.97,0:55:10.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,本物品极度危险
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.07,0:55:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,请勿让儿童触摸
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.41,0:55:18.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,酷毙了,我该炸什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.01,0:55:21.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个胆小的牛仔娃娃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.80,0:55:40.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶,我一直想把,太空人射入太空轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.81,0:55:52.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定了,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.32,0:55:59.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔!不!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.86,0:56:04.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.53,0:56:11.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿薛报告
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.60,0:56:13.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,由于发射地点天候不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.74,0:56:16.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此发射顺延
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.64,0:56:19.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天天气预报,晴天
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.78,0:56:22.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你好梦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.85,0:56:31.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我到处都找过了,我只找到你的帽子而已
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.69,0:56:33.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果他们被丢在这里怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.86,0:56:35.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.49,0:56:38.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们明天离开以前,一定会找到胡迪和巴斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.40,0:56:46.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟的玩具)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.37,0:56:48.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要空气
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.50,0:56:50.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你别动来动去的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.84,0:56:54.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,只是我在旅行之前,会非常的紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.61,0:56:57.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怎么会选你当搬家伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.21,0:57:00.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他人都被选光了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.92,0:57:06.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.29,0:57:12.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你能看到安弟,他有多想你那就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.07,0:57:27.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.38,0:57:38.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,快过来帮我搬走这个工具箱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.19,0:57:43.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.86,0:57:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,没有你我办不到,我需要你的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.23,0:57:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我帮不了你,我帮不了任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.67,0:57:55.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当然可以,巴斯,你可以把我弄出去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.00,0:57:58.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后我替你拆掉火箭,然后我们逃回安弟家去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.04,0:58:02.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟家,阿薛家,有什么差别呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.41,0:58:06.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你八成摔傻了,摔得脑筋都不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.78,0:58:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,胡迪,我的头脑第一次这么清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.19,0:58:13.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说得对,我不是什么太空骑警
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.82,0:58:17.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是一个玩具,一个愚蠢微不足道的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.73,0:58:19.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,想想看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.73,0:58:22.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,当一个玩具,要比当什么太空骑警好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.56,0:58:24.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 才怪 - 我说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.60,0:58:28.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,在那个房子里面,有个小孩认为你是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.34,0:58:30.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那可不是因为你是太空骑警
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.87,0:58:34.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,而是因为你是玩具,你是他的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.74,0:58:36.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟为什么会想要我呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.95,0:58:41.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟为什么会想要你?看看你自己,你是巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.45,0:58:44.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,任何玩具,都愿意被改造成像你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.59,0:58:48.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有飞翼,在黑暗中闪光,还会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.29,0:58:51.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的头盔还会...那样...那样打开来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.73,0:58:55.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是一个很酷的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.27,0:59:01.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说你真的是酷毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.77,0:59:04.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在想...像我这种普通的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.04,0:59:08.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么跟你这么有名的,巴斯光年来比呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.41,0:59:11.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我了不起只会说...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.08,0:59:15.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的靴子里有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.58,0:59:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟只要有了你就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.79,0:59:20.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么还会喜欢我呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.76,0:59:25.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才应该被绑在火箭上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.17,0:59:37.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.85,0:59:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,听好,巴斯,不要管我了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.15,0:59:54.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,趁还来得及你赶快离开吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.83,1:00:07.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你在干什么?我以为...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.40,1:00:10.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,警长,对面有个需要我们的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.44,1:00:12.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我先把你弄出来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.51,1:00:14.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:18.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油,巴斯,我们办得到
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.65,1:00:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,(搬家公司)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.15,1:00:26.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,搬家货车到了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.32,1:00:28.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须快点离开
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.33,1:00:35.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.00,1:00:38.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.83,1:00:42.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯,我出来了 - 快成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.44,1:00:49.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要骑小马
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.65,1:00:58.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,胡迪,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.09,1:01:00.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.47,1:01:15.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了,该发射了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.64,1:01:20.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.38,1:01:32.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.29,1:01:34.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,走开,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.59,1:01:36.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办?加油,胡迪,想啊,想啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.99,1:01:42.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.50,1:01:45.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...等等,不要走,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.27,1:01:49.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯是个好玩具,再过几分钟他就会被炸得粉碎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.44,1:01:52.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是因为我,我们必须救他
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.01,1:01:55.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我需要你们的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.45,1:02:07.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,他是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.32,1:02:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就只剩这么一个朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.07,1:02:26.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,好了,我知道该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.14,1:02:28.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要打破一些小规则
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.78,1:02:31.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果成功了,这对我们大家都好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.05,1:02:33.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟的玩具)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.69,1:02:45.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,休士顿呼叫管制塔,请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.56,1:02:50.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,发射台已架设好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.23,1:02:51.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,听清楚了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.80,1:02:54.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要帮浦到这里,鸭子到这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.74,1:02:58.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,长腿跟鸭子一组
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.64,1:03:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟滑板听到讯号声才出动,懂吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.01,1:03:04.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,行动吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.53,1:03:26.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,替青蛙上发条
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.72,1:03:50.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,等他的信号
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.24,1:04:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.15,1:04:13.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.25,1:04:15.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.38,1:04:17.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.79,1:04:19.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,来了,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.06,1:04:30.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿德!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.50,1:04:36.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,大笨狗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.98,1:04:45.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,往后仰!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.25,1:04:54.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,管制塔,发射台已经完工了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.49,1:04:57.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到了,火箭现在已接到导引线
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.16,1:05:00.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在正在装置,点火装置杆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.46,1:05:01.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就会开始倒数计时
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.96,1:05:04.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 待命 - 我们上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.33,1:05:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈,火柴在哪里?在这里,我找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.84,1:05:10.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,太好了,快点帮我弄开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.50,1:05:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 别担心,我有锦囊妙计
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.68,1:05:17.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.01,1:05:23.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,休士顿,所有系统正常,请求允许发射
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.35,1:05:27.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这里?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.49,1:05:31.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,我们等一下可以烤肉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.83,1:05:36.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,休士顿,我们可以发射了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.30,1:05:38.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到了,请求照准
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.80,1:05:43.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,倒数十秒后就可以发射了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.54,1:05:47.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,倒数十秒,十,九...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.31,1:05:50.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,八,七,六...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.14,1:05:53.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,五,四,三,二...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.08,1:05:57.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一! - 把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.89,1:06:01.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你休想在这里为非作歹
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.92,1:06:02.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.99,1:06:06.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人对水源下了毒
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.53,1:06:10.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它坏掉了 - 是谁说我坏掉了?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.06,1:06:12.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.13,1:06:16.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是在跟你说话,阿薛菲利普
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.34,1:06:19.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不想被炸掉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.07,1:06:21.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,不想被打烂,也不想被拆开
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.14,1:06:24.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们? - 没错,你的玩具们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.41,1:06:26.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.85,1:06:29.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.12,1:06:32.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.34,1:06:55.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.58,1:07:00.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,从现在起,你得好好照顾你的玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.98,1:07:05.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你不照做,我们会知道,阿薛
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.25,1:07:10.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们玩具可以看到一切事情
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.33,1:07:14.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你要乖一点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.13,1:07:24.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,成功了!办到了!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.84,1:07:27.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些玩具...他们是活的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.64,1:07:29.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,娃娃乖乖
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.08,1:07:34.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿薛,你是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.78,1:07:37.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不想跟莎莉玩吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.58,1:07:40.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,各位,非常好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.35,1:07:43.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们合作愉快,真的是太精采了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.29,1:07:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.39,1:07:47.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.80,1:07:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟房子说再见
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.83,1:07:54.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪,你看 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.97,1:07:58.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得走了,谢了,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.11,1:08:03.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.11,1:08:10.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你先走,我会赶上的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.37,1:08:31.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,(搬运专家  从东岸到西岸)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.64,1:08:32.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,快来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.72,1:08:50.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,你办得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.39,1:08:54.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓到了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.89,1:08:56.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.57,1:09:03.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,走开,你这只笨狗,走开,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.90,1:09:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要,不要 - 胡迪,撑着点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.67,1:09:09.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我...我撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.91,1:09:13.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,替我照顾安弟
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.58,1:09:15.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.35,1:09:17.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.14,1:09:46.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经到了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.31,1:09:47.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪 - 你怎么会跑来?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.98,1:09:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪,你是怎么来的? - 你到哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.38,1:09:50.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,出了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.65,1:09:52.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 他在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.89,1:09:54.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.05,1:09:56.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在干什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.13,1:10:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!他又杀人了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.57,1:10:15.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快去抓他 - 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.05,1:10:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.52,1:10:31.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...等等...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.03,1:10:41.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,胖猪,压顶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.72,1:11:06.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快点下车 - 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.29,1:11:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,你们不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.36,1:11:12.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯有危险,我们得帮他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.47,1:11:14.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要,住手 - 这个杀人凶手,把他丢下去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.83,1:11:16.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.04,1:11:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好耶 - 胡迪,再见啦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.91,1:11:28.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.22,1:11:31.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你让我搭便车 - 小心!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.16,1:11:37.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,我们快去追那辆卡车
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.52,1:11:38.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,(涡轮引擎)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.50,1:11:44.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,(杂物)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.70,1:11:48.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,各位,胡迪在开遥控车
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.47,1:11:50.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯跟他在一起 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.01,1:11:55.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的是巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.68,1:11:57.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪说的是实话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.01,1:12:01.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们做了什么啊? - 这下好了,我有罪恶感
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.18,1:12:04.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就快要到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.68,1:12:08.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基,放下斜坡
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.79,1:12:10.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,(升降机)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.13,1:12:15.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.36,1:12:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,抓住我的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.54,1:12:29.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干得好,弹簧狗 - 胡迪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.71,1:12:30.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,加速啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.04,1:12:34.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 加速 - 电池已经没有电了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.45,1:12:43.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 哈库拉,玛塔塔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.22,1:12:45.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 多棒的一句话 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.40,1:12:55.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我快撑不下去了 - 弹簧狗,你要撑住
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.45,1:13:12.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,这下好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.49,1:13:15.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,火箭
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:19.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,火柴,好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.13,1:13:21.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了,阿薛
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.40,1:13:30.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.87,1:13:33.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.94,1:13:37.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...不...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.54,1:13:39.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.61,1:13:42.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.36,1:13:54.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪,你在干什么? - 巴斯,不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.43,1:13:57.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你办到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.50,1:13:59.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一站...安弟
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.73,1:14:03.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,我刚刚点着了火箭,火箭会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.81,1:14:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该多撑几秒的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.05,1:14:20.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看,胡迪和巴斯冲过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.69,1:14:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.50,1:14:32.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,快找掩护
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.57,1:14:42.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会被炸成碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.21,1:14:44.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天不会
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.32,1:14:57.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你在飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.69,1:15:00.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不叫飞行,这叫做摔得很炫
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.36,1:15:08.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.07,1:15:16.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,我们超过卡车了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.18,1:15:18.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们并不是要到卡车上
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.05,1:15:26.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,哇赛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.15,1:15:28.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 胡迪,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.25,1:15:30.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了,你找到了,它们在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.26,1:15:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就在车上 - 看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.52,1:15:36.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就跟你说过你会找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.70,1:15:48.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈咪,我先拆哪一个? - 让茉莉拆一个礼物
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.01,1:15:55.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,牛奶,听到请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.75,1:15:57.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿,注意,好戏上场了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.88,1:16:00.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,快过去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.92,1:16:03.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.49,1:16:05.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你下次叫我,能不能试着温柔点?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.89,1:16:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.09,1:16:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是檞寄生吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.33,1:16:17.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许安弟会有一只新的恐龙,草食性恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.40,1:16:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,那样我就能当...可怕的肉食动物
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.81,1:16:22.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静,各位安静
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.07,1:16:25.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,茉莉的第一件礼物是...蛋头太太
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.74,1:16:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,重复,蛋头太太
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.91,1:16:29.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,恭喜你,蛋头兄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.95,1:16:32.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我该刮胡子了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.96,1:16:38.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,牛奶,请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.26,1:16:40.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟现在正在拆,他的第一个礼物
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.63,1:16:42.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是... - 巴斯,巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.59,1:16:45.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不太明白... - 你不会是在担心吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.23,1:16:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我,不是... - 被挡住了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.77,1:16:49.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...不...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.13,1:16:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是一个很大的盒子,那是...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.84,1:16:54.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你呢? - 巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.61,1:16:59.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管安弟得到的什么礼物,都不会比你更糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.85,1:17:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么,是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.21,1:17:04.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇,一只小狗狗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.06,1:17:22.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.67,1:17:26.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.94,1:17:31.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 当前面的路看起来很崎岖时 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.18,1:17:36.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你离温暖的床越来越远了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.18,1:17:39.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你只记得你的老朋友说过什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:42.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 孩子，你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.86,1:17:47.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 是的，你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.90,1:17:55.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.10,1:17:59.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.31,1:18:05.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有麻烦，我也有 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.54,1:18:09.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 我不会为你做任何事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.61,1:18:12.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我们团结在一起，我们就能看穿它 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.72,1:18:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 因为我是你的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.86,1:18:20.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.19,1:18:26.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 其他人可能比我聪明一点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.33,1:18:29.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 也更大更强 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.37,1:18:30.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 也许吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.54,1:18:36.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 但是没有人会像我那样爱你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.21,1:18:38.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 是我和你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.88,1:18:42.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 随着岁月的流逝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.38,1:18:45.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 我们的友谊永不消逝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.09,1:18:51.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你会看到这是我们的命运 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.06,1:18:55.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.96,1:18:58.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.23,1:19:02.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ 你有我的朋友 ∮
